ing extra spacing on structural elements\n- Add dark/light mode toggle to sidebar with localStorage persistence\n- Fix About stats border-r on mobile 2-col layout (sm: breakpoint guard)\n- Fix Projects section header spacing mb-12 → mb-14 for consistency\n- Replace ''Previous Company'' placeholder with ''Various Clients (India)''\n- Derive Contact social link text from URL data instead of hardcoding\n- Remove fake Analytics/GTM scripts with placeholder IDs from layout\n- Strip non-functional bg-background/text-foreground from ThemeProvider\n- Add dark mode init script to prevent flash on page load\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b328a3edaabe5f71d54b92f4226f0b30796fc11a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kundan0887/kundan-pawar-portfolio/git/trees/b328a3edaabe5f71d54b92f4226f0b30796fc11a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kundan0887/kundan-pawar-portfolio/git/commits/cb85208e0683a9d03dec6542766b7c0c886b333a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63604244?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kundan0887/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kundan0887/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kundan0887/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kundan0887/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kundan0887","id":63604244,"login":"kundan0887","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNjA0MjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kundan0887/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kundan0887/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kundan0887/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kundan0887/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kundan0887/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.co