ed by topic (Dev, Features, etc.)\n├── System Overview - Core features tree map\n├── Technology Stack - Frontend/backend details\n├── Architecture Highlights - Modular service architecture\n├── Recent Achievements - Latest fixes and improvements\n└── Documentation Index - Table linking all doc files\n\nKey Benefits\n├── Maintainability - Large file broken into focused sections\n├── Discoverability - Clear index and navigation paths\n├── Scalability - Easy to add new focused docs as needed\n├── User Experience - Developers can find info quickly\n└── Historical Context - Chronological fix tracking preserved\n\nReference Strategy\n├── CHART.md - Primary entry point for all chart documentation\n├── FIXES_HISTORY.md - Detailed chronological fix summaries\n├── docs/chart/README.md - Explains current status and future plans\n├── CHART_SHARING_DOCUMENTATION.md - Comprehensive 2425-line reference\n└── README.md - Links to all chart documentation\n\nFuture Expansion\n├── ARCHITECTURE.md - System components and data flow (planned)\n├── SHARING.md - Chart sharing implementation (planned)\n├── DEVELOPMENT.md - Guidelines, testing, standards (planned)\n└── USER_FEATURES.md - User-facing features docs (planned)\n\nThis establishes a scalable, maintainable documentation system that can grow with the project while maintaining clarity and organization. The comprehensive reference document is preserved for detailed technical information, while the modular structure provides quick navigation and focused content.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a3c7a765aa371c1423545a42309c36cacfd87aa2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/a3c7a765aa371c1423545a42309c36cacfd87aa2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/commits/07a364b070921b8d507ce8a95fe097ef2a8c8d5d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verifi