 & Database Reliability\n├── Round 28 - 95% Code Reduction (Modular Architecture)\n└── Rounds 27-23 - Type Safety, Validation, Earlier Fixes\n\nBenefits\n├── Maintainability - 2425-line file split into focused documents\n├── Navigation - Quick access to relevant information\n├── Discoverability - Clear index and cross-references\n├── Onboarding - Developers can find information quickly\n└── Historical Context - Chronological fix tracking\n\nNext Steps\n├── Create ARCHITECTURE.md - System components and data flow\n├── Create SHARING.md - Chart sharing implementation details\n├── Create DEVELOPMENT.md - Guidelines, testing, standards\n└── Create USER_FEATURES.md - Stellium persistence, avatar display\n\nThis establishes a scalable documentation system that grows with the project while maintaining clarity and accessibility.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"88975f004570df4a3ceba669beb8e9c81c63b231","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/88975f004570df4a3ceba669beb8e9c81c63b231"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/commits/6512f05f197e8755238c2d5b6cce6b4a2208f3f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received