b.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/cb533bea955315c65a82aee418ef93c9c5dc83dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-16T06:03:54Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-16T06:03:54Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"message":"Add comprehensive Vertex aspect interpretations for all celestial points\n\nAdded detailed aspect interpretations for Vertex with all celestial points:\n- Lilith to Vertex (conjunction, sextile, square, trine, opposition, quincunx)\n- Chiron to Vertex (all 6 aspects)\n- North Node to Vertex (all 6 aspects)\n- South Node to Vertex (all 6 aspects)\n- Part of Fortune to Vertex (all 6 aspects - new section created)\n\nThis resolves the issue where celestial point to Vertex aspects were showing\ngeneric fallback messages like \"These energies work together harmoniously and\nsupportively\" instead of meaningful interpretations.\n\nEach interpretation follows the established pattern:\n- Conjunction: Energy alignment and personality integration\n- Sextile: Supportive opportunities through conscious work\n- Square: Tension requiring growth and integration\n- Trine: Natural flow and effortless expression\n- Opposition: Awareness and balance of polarities\n- Quincunx: Ongoing adjustment and flexible adaptation\n\nAll interpretations focus on fated encounters, destiny points, significant\nrelationships, and life-changing connections specific to each celestial point''s\ncore themes (shadow work for Lilith, healing for Chiron, karmic mission for\nNorth Node, past patterns for South Node, prosperity for Part of Fortune).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f2145b099f6de964512602a971d085eadb8b75c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/f2145b099f6de964512602a971d085eadb8b75c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister