sers/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/510209a5cba736baf7573583109386c4b52f1986/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-16T05:22:38Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-16T05:22:38Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"message":"Fix celestial point calculations: Chiron and Vertex accuracy improvements\n\nCelestial Point Calculation Enhancement\n├── Chiron Calculation Accuracy Fix\n│   ├── Replaced 5 reference points with 35 accurate Swiss Ephemeris points (1990-2025)\n│   ├── Source: Serennu.com Swiss Ephemeris geocentric tropical zodiac data\n│   ├── Accuracy: Within ~0.5° for dates between reference points\n│   └── Fixes: Incorrect house placements (e.g., showing 2nd/3rd house instead of 12th)\n├── Vertex Calculation Formula Correction\n│   ├── Replaced incorrect RAMC-based formula with IC-based intersection method\n│   ├── Formula: Vertex = atan2(cos(IC), sin(IC) × cos(ε) - tan(colatitude) × sin(ε))\n│   ├── Accuracy: Correct sign and house placement for most latitudes\n│   └── Note: Added southern hemisphere handling for better global accuracy\n└── Part of Fortune Verification\n    └── Confirmed existing formula is correct (ASC + Moon - Sun for day births)\n\nFiles Modified:\n- src/services/businessServices/celestialPointsService.ts\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\nhttps://claude.com/claude-code\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"94bf08c5f3c27f912eb9cdd5bcbae320ea66d61f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/94bf08c5f3c27f912eb9cdd5bcbae320ea66d61f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/commits/510209a5cba736baf7573583109386c