 South Node, and Part of Fortune aspects\n- Replaced generic fallback descriptions with psychologically-informed spiritual guidance\n- Maintained consistency with existing planetary aspect interpretation style\n- All 6 major aspect types covered (conjunction, sextile, square, trine, opposition, quincunx)\n- Bidirectional lookup support preserved for flexible access patterns\n\nUser Experience Impact:\n- Consistent interpretation quality across all aspect types\n- Rich spiritual and karmic guidance for celestial point combinations\n- Professional-grade astrological insights matching planetary aspects\n\nTechnical Implementation:\n- Modified: src/utils/astrological/celestialPointAspects.ts\n- Added: CELESTIAL POINT TO CELESTIAL POINT ASPECTS section (145 interpretations)\n- Verified: TypeScript ✅ ESLint ✅ Zero errors\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0727a5238f785bbc9d2a92ab714cf8e9c5487134","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/0727a5238f785bbc9d2a92ab714cf8e9c5487134"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/commits/28e415899cb28a558b5a4551e255e097f3a98bd4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github