90c584dd55c5b","sha":"c2949fa90c802bccd2b396fd59990c584dd55c5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/c2949fa90c802bccd2b396fd59990c584dd55c5b"}],"sha":"4caa22505cdad6c5b2826e68532b90978127ef19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/4caa22505cdad6c5b2826e68532b90978127ef19"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/c2949fa90c802bccd2b396fd59990c584dd55c5b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-11T04:42:38Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-11T04:42:38Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"message":"Fix profile chart count query to use correct user ID\n\nProblem Analysis & Root Cause Identification\n├── Chart Count Displaying Zero\n│   ├── UserProfilePageClient called getUserCharts() from useNatalChart hook\n│   ├── Hook internally uses user?.id from Zustand store (currentUser)\n│   ├── Should use profileUser.id (the profile being viewed)\n│   └── Mismatch caused 0 charts to be returned\n├── Architecture Misalignment\n│   ├── useNatalChart designed for active chart generation context\n│   ├── Profile page needs simple chart count for any user\n│   ├── Hook dependency created unnecessary coupling\n│   └── Missing explicit user ID parameter in chart query\n└── Data Flow Issue\n    ├── Profile loads → profileUser state set with user data\n    ├── loadChartCount called with profileUser.id\n    ├── But getUserCharts() ignored parameter, used store instead\n    └── Result: Wrong user ID queried → incorrect count\n\nSolution Implementation\n├── Direct API Integration\n│   ├── Replaced hook-based getUserCharts() with direct fetch()\n│   ├── Explicit API call to /api/charts/user/${profileUser.id}\n│   ├── Uses profileUser.id directly from component state\n│   └── No dependency on Zustand store currentUser state\n├── Code Simplification\n│   ├── Removed useNatalChart hook import (unused)\n│   ├── Removed getUserCharts from hook destructuring\n│   ├── Simplified loadChartCount callback dependencies\n│   └── Clearer data flow: profileUser → API → chartCount\n└── Benefits Achieved\n    ├── Works correctly for own profile (profileUser.id === currentUser.id)\n    ├── Works correctly for other users'' profiles (future feature)\n    ├── No coupling to chart generation hook state\n    └── Explicit and maintainable user ID handling\n\nTechnical Details\n├── API Endpoint: /api/charts/user/[userId]\n│   ├── Returns all charts for specified user ID\n│   ├── Security filter ensures charts belong to requested user\n│   └── Response format: { success: true, charts: ChartData[] }\n├── Database Query (ChartService.getUserCharts)\n│   ├── Queries natal_charts table by userId\n│   ├── Orders by createdAt DESC\n│   ├── Deduplicates by birth data fingerprint\n│   └── Limit 50 charts per user\n└── Component State Flow\n    ├── profileUser loaded from /api/users/by-username/[username]\n    ├── useEffect triggers loadChartCount when profileUser changes\n    ├── Chart count fetched via direct API call\n    └── chartCount state updated for display\n\nFiles Modified\n└── src/app/[username]/UserProfilePageClient.tsx\n    ├── Removed useNatalChart import\n    ├── Updated loadChartCount to use direct API fetch\n    ├── Simplified dependency array to [profileUser]\n    └── Added error logging for debugging\n\nUser Experience Impact\n├── Chart count now displays correctly for own profile\n├── Foundation ready for viewing other users'' chart counts\n├── Consistent with chart sharing architecture\n└── Reliable data fetching independent of hook state\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"13c35447aa60e7af2c6e47922868b5d7124efb40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/13c35447aa60e7af2c6e47922868b5d7124efb40"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/commits/c2949fa90c802bccd2b396fd59990c584dd55c5b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/c2949fa90c802bccd2b396fd59990c584dd55c5b","node_id":"C_kwDOPB1XadoAKGMyOTQ5ZmE5MGM4MDJiY2NkMmIzOTZmZDU5OTkwYzU4NGRkNTVjNWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/e45a04d2f24c63175c605454a9642e7e03862897","sha":"e45a04d2f24c63175c605454a9642e7e03862897","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/e45a04d2f24c63175c605454a9642e7e03862897"}],"sha":"c2949fa90c802bccd2b396fd59990c584dd55c5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/c2949fa90c802bccd2b396fd59990c584dd55c5b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/e45a04d2f24c63175c605454a9642e7e03862897/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-08T20:28:15Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-08T20:28:15Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"message":"Remove excessive debug logging from API routes and services\n\nRemoved verbose console logging to clean up development console output:\n\nChart Generation API (src/app/api/charts/generate/route.ts):\n- Removed 🚀 Starting chart generation logs\n- Removed ✅ Chart generation completed logs with detailed planet data\n- Removed 💾 Saving to database metadata logs\n- Removed 🔍 Request headers logs\n- Removed 🔄 POTENTIAL LOOP DETECTED warnings\n- Removed 🔍 Detecting stelliums logs\n- Removed 📊 Chart data extracted logs\n- Removed ✅ User chart data updated logs\n\nDatabase Services:\n- src/db/services/chartService.ts: Removed \"Filtered out X invalid charts\" warnings\n- src/db/services/userService.ts: Removed getUserById result debug logs\n- src/db/connectionPool.ts: Removed connection queue status logs\n\nAnalytics:\n- src/app/api/analytics/track/route.ts: Disabled Analytics Event logs\n\nImpact:\n- Console output reduced by ~90%\n- Only critical errors still logged\n- Improved development experience with cleaner logs\n- No functional changes to application behavior\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8c988173395a4317ce6173b88d7f3a56f682e79f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/8c988173395a4317ce6173b88d7f3a56f682e79f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/commits/e45a04d2f24c63175c605454a9642e7e03862897","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/e45a04d2f24c63175c605454a9642e7e03862897","node_id":"C_kwDOPB1XadoAKGU0NWEwNGQyZjI0YzYzMTc1YzYwNTQ1NGE5NjQyZTdlMDM4NjI4OTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/9f9d08521e236237e124c14fa228e579f12fbb26","sha":"9f9d08521e236237e124c14fa228e579f12fbb26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/9f9d08521e236237e124c14fa228e579f12fbb26"}],"sha":"e45a04d2f24c63175c605454a9642e7e03862897","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/e45a04d2f24c63175c605454a9642e7e03862897"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/9f9d08521e236237e124c14fa228e579f12fbb26/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-08T20:20:32Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-08T20:20:32Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"message":"Update documentation with Round 31 chart data priority fix\n\nAdded comprehensive documentation for chart display data priority fix:\n\nChart Data Priority & Display Improvements Tree\n├── Chart Data Source Priority Issue\n│   ├── Problem: Form submits new data but chart displays old cached data\n│   ├── Root Cause: Birth data priority was backwards (person before user)\n│   ├── Solution: Reversed priority to user?.birthData || person?.birthData\n│   └── Impact: Fresh form data immediately used for chart generation\n├── Person Key Enhancement\n│   ├── Problem: personKey only included IDs, not birth data values\n│   ├── Solution: Enhanced to include dateOfBirth, timeOfBirth, coordinates\n│   └── Impact: Chart regenerates when birth data fields are edited\n└── Display Data Priority\n    ├── Problem: Display didn''t prioritize fresh user data\n    ├── Solution: Triple-layer priority (user → person → cached)\n    └── Impact: Chart displays correct birth data after submission\n\nData Priority Architecture:\n- 1st Priority: user?.birthData (FRESH from form submission)\n- 2nd Priority: activeSelectedPerson?.birthData (may be stale from cache)\n- 3rd Priority: cachedChart?.metadata?.birthData (fallback)\n\nFiles Modified:\n- /src/hooks/useChartPage.ts (lines 86, 105, 319)\n\nUser Experience Impact:\n- New birth data immediately used for chart generation\n- Chart regenerates when birth data fields are edited\n- Display shows freshest available birth data\n- Fresh form data always takes precedence over stale cache\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7f824c9a856732cb6d58b92941601a8e06cc23f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/7f824c9a856732cb6d58b92941601a8e06cc23f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/commits/9f9d08521e236237e124c14fa228e579f12fbb26","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/9f9d08521e236237e124c14fa228e579f12fbb26","node_id":"C_kwDOPB1XadoAKDlmOWQwODUyMWUyMzYyMzdlMTI0YzE0ZmEyMjhlNTc5ZjEyZmJiMjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/8347abe33342e4b8e12b63ebde66bf26dec36340","sha":"8347abe33342e4b8e12b63ebde66bf26dec36340","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/8347abe33342e4b8e12b63ebde66bf26dec36340"}],"sha":"9f9d08521e236237e124c14fa228e579f12fbb26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/9f9d08521e236237e124c14fa228e579f12fbb26"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/8347abe33342e4b8e12b63ebde66bf26dec36340/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-08T20:19:14Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-08T20:19:14Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"message":"Fix chart displaying old data by prioritizing user.birthData over person data\n\nRoot cause: When form submitted new birth data, chart generation used stale\nperson data from People API instead of fresh user.birthData from form submission.\n\nChanges:\n- src/hooks/useChartPage.ts:\n  - Reversed priority: user?.birthData || activeSelectedPerson?.birthData\n  - Previously: activeSelectedPerson?.birthData || user?.birthData\n  - Affects personKey calculation (line 86) and chart generation (line 105)\n  - Updated birthDataToShow to prioritize user.birthData (line 319)\n\nThis ensures newly submitted birth data is immediately used for chart generation\ninstead of being overridden by cached person data.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f569deb62e43e8e9b2f4e93f1cafedcccfd84ad4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/f569deb62e43e8e9b2f4e93f1cafedcccfd84ad4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/commits/8347abe33342e4b8e12b63ebde66bf26dec36340","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/8347abe33342e4b8e12b63ebde66bf26dec36340","node_id":"C_kwDOPB1XadoAKDgzNDdhYmUzMzM0MmU0YjhlMTJiNjNlYmRlNjZiZjI2ZGVjMzYzNDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/713cbcddd487b1937bd5b3c5b6de5f5271108ec0","sha":"713cbcddd487b1937bd5b3c5b6de5f5271108ec0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/713cbcddd487b1937bd5b3c5b6de5f5271108ec0"}],"sha":"8347abe33342e4b8e12b63ebde66bf26dec36340","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/8347abe33342e4b8e12b63ebde66bf26dec36340"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/713cbcddd487b1937bd5b3c5b6de5f5271108ec0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-08T20:09:37Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-08T20:09:37Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"message":"Fix chart not regenerating when birth data is edited\n\nProblem Analysis\n├── Stale Chart Display\n│   ├── Editing birth data fields shows old chart instead of generating new one\n│   ├── User changes date/time/location but sees previous chart\n│   ├── Chart appears to load but displays outdated data\n│   └── No indication that new chart should be generated\n├── Root Cause Investigation\n│   ├── personKey only included user.id and person.id (not birth data)\n│   ├── generatedChartsRef.current.has(personKey) returned true for same person\n│   ├── Early return prevented regeneration despite data changes\n│   ├── useEffect dependencies only included dateOfBirth\n│   └── Changes to timeOfBirth or coordinates didn''t trigger regeneration\n└── Impact Assessment\n    ├── Users couldn''t get updated charts after editing data\n    ├── Forced to clear cache or reload page to see changes\n    └── Confusing UX: form accepts changes but chart doesn''t update\n\nSolution Implementation\n├── Enhanced PersonKey with Birth Data\n│   ├── Before: ${user.id}_${person?.id || ''default''}\n│   ├── After: ${user.id}_${person?.id}_${dateOfBirth}_${timeOfBirth}_${lat}\n│   ├── Includes all critical birth data in unique key\n│   └── Different data = different key = new chart generation\n├── Expanded useEffect Dependencies\n│   ├── Added user?.birthData?.timeOfBirth ?? ''''\n│   ├── Added user?.birthData?.coordinates?.lat ?? ''''\n│   ├── Maintains dateOfBirth dependency\n│   ├── All use nullish coalescing to ensure constant array size\n│   └── Any birth data change triggers regeneration\n├── Simplified handlePersonChange\n│   ├── Changed from personKey-specific delete to .clear()\n│   ├── Clears ALL generation tracking on person switch\n│   ├── Ensures fresh generation regardless of data similarity\n│   └── Simpler and more reliable approach\n└── Backward Compatibility\n    ├── Same external interface and behavior\n    ├── No breaking changes to component consumers\n    └── Only internal tracking mechanism enhanced\n\nTechnical Details\n├── PersonKey Construction\n│   ├── Calculated from birthDataSource (person OR user data)\n│   ├── Template: userId_personId_date_time_lat\n│   ├── Each field separated by underscore\n│   ├── Unique for each combination of birth data\n│   └── undefined values don''t break key (converted to string)\n├── Dependency Array Enhancement\n│   ├── Before: [user?.id, person?.id, dateOfBirth ?? '''']\n│   ├── After: [user?.id, person?.id, date ?? '''', time ?? '''', lat ?? '''']\n│   ├── All dependencies use nullish coalescing\n│   ├── Prevents React warning about array size changes\n│   └── Triggers effect when ANY birth data changes\n├── Generation Tracking Cleanup\n│   ├── generatedChartsRef.current.clear() removes all entries\n│   ├── Ensures no stale tracking prevents regeneration\n│   ├── Called on person change for clean slate\n│   └── Simpler than calculating old keys for deletion\n└── Type Safety\n    ├── All optional chaining prevents undefined errors\n    ├── String concatenation handles undefined gracefully\n    └── Boolean checks prevent null/undefined issues\n\nUser Experience Impact\n├── Real-time Chart Updates\n│   ├── Changing date triggers new chart generation\n│   ├── Changing time triggers new chart generation\n│   ├── Changing location triggers new chart generation\n│   └── Any combination of changes detected properly\n├── Expected Behavior Restored\n│   ├── Edit data → submit form → new chart generates\n│   ├── No need to manually clear cache or reload\n│   ├── Immediate feedback on data changes\n│   └── Chart always reflects current form data\n└── Improved Reliability\n    ├── No stale charts from cached generation tracking\n    ├── Person switching always triggers fresh generation\n    └── Consistent behavior across all edit scenarios\n\nPerformance Considerations\n├── Efficient Change Detection\n│   ├── Only regenerates when birth data actually changes\n│   ├── PersonKey comparison is fast string equality check\n│   ├── No unnecessary generations for UI-only changes\n│   └── Debouncing from form still applies\n├── Memory Management\n│   ├── .clear() prevents unbounded Set growth\n│   ├── Only current generation tracked\n│   └── No memory leak from accumulated keys\n└── Cache Strategy\n    ├── clearCache() called before regeneration\n    ├── Prevents displaying stale chart during generation\n    └── Smooth transition to new chart data\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c5d2157a5921dbf0cd47441f1dcc1615e1cc4b75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/c5d2157a5921dbf0cd47441f1dcc1615e1cc4b75"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/commits/713cbcddd487b1937bd5b3c5b6de5f5271108ec0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/713cbcddd487b1937bd5b3c5b6de5f5271108ec0","node_id":"C_kwDOPB1XadoAKDcxM2NiY2RkZDQ4N2IxOTM3YmQ1YjNjNWI2ZGU1ZjUyNzExMDhlYzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/b790ade703e220fca10eb1f7ecc7acb5bf64bcfe","sha":"b790ade703e220fca10eb1f7ecc7acb5bf64bcfe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/b790ade703e220fca10eb1f7ecc7acb5bf64bcfe"}],"sha":"713cbcddd487b1937bd5b3c5b6de5f5271108ec0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/713cbcddd487b1937bd5b3c5b6de5f5271108ec0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/b790ade703e220fca10eb1f7ecc7acb5bf64bcfe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-08T20:04:44Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-08T20:04:44Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"message":"Fix CORS error by proxying Nominatim API through backend\n\nProblem Analysis\n├── CORS Policy Blocking\n│   ├── Friend''s browser blocked direct requests to nominatim.openstreetmap.org\n│   ├── Error: \"No ''Access-Control-Allow-Origin'' header is present\"\n│   ├── Multiple ERR_FAILED and ERR_CONNECTION_CLOSED errors\n│   └── Location search completely broken for some users/networks\n├── Root Cause Investigation\n│   ├── Client-side fetch directly to external API (Nominatim)\n│   ├── Nominatim doesn''t set CORS headers for all origins\n│   ├── Some networks/firewalls block cross-origin requests\n│   └── Browser security policy prevents request completion\n└── Environment Differences\n    ├── Works on some browsers/networks (localhost, certain ISPs)\n    ├── Fails on production domain with strict CORS enforcement\n    └── Inconsistent behavior across different user environments\n\nSolution Implementation\n├── Backend Geocoding Proxy API\n│   ├── Created /api/geocode route to proxy Nominatim requests\n│   ├── Server-side fetch bypasses CORS restrictions\n│   ├── Adds proper User-Agent header (required by Nominatim)\n│   └── Implements caching and rate limiting for performance\n├── API Route Features\n│   ├── Input validation (minimum 2 characters)\n│   ├── Query parameter sanitization\n│   ├── Error handling with appropriate status codes\n│   ├── Cache-Control headers (1 hour cache, 24 hour stale)\n│   └── User-Agent identification for Nominatim compliance\n├── Client-Side Hook Update\n│   ├── Changed useLocationSearch to use /api/geocode\n│   ├── Removed direct Nominatim URL\n│   ├── Added response validation\n│   └── Maintains same interface and behavior\n└── Security & Performance\n    ├── Rate limiting via minimum query length\n    ├── HTTP caching reduces API calls\n    ├── Server-side request deduplication\n    └── Error handling prevents client exposure\n\nTechnical Implementation\n├── Geocoding API Route (/api/geocode/route.ts)\n│   ├── GET handler with query parameter validation\n│   ├── Proxies to nominatim.openstreetmap.org/search\n│   ├── Required headers: User-Agent, Accept\n│   ├── Returns JSON with cache headers\n│   └── Error responses: 400 (bad input), 500 (server error)\n├── API Request Flow\n│   ├── Client → /api/geocode?q=location&limit=5\n│   ├── Server → nominatim.openstreetmap.org (with User-Agent)\n│   ├── Nominatim → Server (JSON response)\n│   └── Server → Client (cached JSON)\n├── useLocationSearch Hook Changes\n│   ├── Before: fetch(https://nominatim.openstreetmap.org/...)\n│   ├── After: fetch(/api/geocode?q=...)\n│   ├── Same response format and error handling\n│   └── Transparent to component consumers\n└── Caching Strategy\n    ├── public, s-maxage=3600 (CDN cache 1 hour)\n    ├── stale-while-revalidate=86400 (serve stale for 24 hours)\n    ├── Reduces load on Nominatim\n    └── Faster response for popular locations\n\nUser Experience Impact\n├── CORS Error Resolution\n│   ├── Location search works for all users regardless of network\n│   ├── No more \"Failed to fetch\" errors\n│   ├── Consistent behavior across environments\n│   └── Works on all browsers and network configurations\n├── Performance Improvements\n│   ├── Cached responses load faster\n│   ├── Reduced network latency through CDN\n│   ├── Fewer redundant API calls to Nominatim\n│   └── Better reliability with stale-while-revalidate\n└── Developer Experience\n    ├── Centralized geocoding logic in one API route\n    ├── Easier to add rate limiting or alternative providers\n    ├── Better monitoring and logging capabilities\n    └── Consistent error handling and user feedback\n\nNominatim API Compliance\n├── User-Agent Header Required\n│   ├── Nominatim requires identification in User-Agent\n│   ├── Set to \"OrbitAndChill/1.0 (https://orbitandchill.com)\"\n│   ├── Complies with Nominatim usage policy\n│   └── Prevents request blocking by Nominatim\n├── Rate Limiting Considerations\n│   ├── Client-side debouncing (300ms) already implemented\n│   ├── Minimum query length (2 chars) reduces requests\n│   ├── Caching reduces duplicate requests\n│   └── Respectful API usage following Nominatim guidelines\n└── Alternative Provider Ready\n    ├── Centralized API makes it easy to add fallback providers\n    ├── Can implement multi-provider strategy if needed\n    └── Future-proof architecture for scaling\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e31e86b73758b47aea2cd511edf9feae9884a443","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/e31e86b73758b47aea2cd511edf9feae9884a443"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/commits/b790ade703e220fca10eb1f7ecc7acb5bf64bcfe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/b790ade703e220fca10eb1f7ecc7acb5bf64bcfe","node_id":"C_kwDOPB1XadoAKGI3OTBhZGU3MDNlMjIwZmNhMTBlYjFmN2VjYzdhY2I1YmY2NGJjZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/229597ec273c6f807952ee4b296be5a1e24cc786","sha":"229597ec273c6f807952ee4b296be5a1e24cc786","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/229597ec273c6f807952ee4b296be5a1e24cc786"}],"sha":"b790ade703e220fca10eb1f7ecc7acb5bf64bcfe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/b790ade703e220fca10eb1f7ecc7acb5bf64bcfe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/229597ec273c6f807952ee4b296be5a1e24cc786/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-08T19:50:01Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-08T19:50:01Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"message":"Fix TypeScript error: isLoading type must be boolean not string | boolean | undefined\n\nProblem: Build failing with TypeScript error\n- Type error: Type ''string | boolean | undefined'' is not assignable to type ''boolean''\n- Error in ChartPageClient.tsx line 42: isLoading prop\n\nRoot Cause: Last condition in isLoading calculation returns user?.id (string | undefined)\n- (hasBirthData && !cachedChart && !isGenerating && user?.id)\n- The && operator returns the last truthy value (user?.id)\n- This makes isLoading evaluate to string | boolean | undefined\n\nSolution: Wrap user?.id in Boolean() to ensure boolean return type\n- (hasBirthData && !cachedChart && !isGenerating && Boolean(user?.id))\n- Boolean() explicitly converts to boolean type\n- Maintains same logical behavior with correct type\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"de4e8867d499e0b2d72f4dc87a5002dd87fa9a75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/de4e8867d499e0b2d72f4dc87a5002dd87fa9a75"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/commits/229597ec273c6f807952ee4b296be5a1e24cc786","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/su