"date":"2025-10-08T19:30:00Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"message":"Update documentation with Round 30 chart loading state improvements\n\nAdded comprehensive documentation for:\n- Dynamic loading message system with hasBirthData detection\n- Chart generation trigger fix with birthDataSource fallback\n- API error handling enhancement for JSON parsing\n- New message hierarchy showing all loading states\n- Files modified and user experience impact\n- Technical excellence highlights\n\nRound 30 focuses on providing accurate, contextual feedback throughout\nthe chart creation process, from form submission through generation.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f98ede73af199baa392543f32b46b34cb521fb27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/f98ede73af199baa392543f32b46b34cb521fb27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/commits/9e40504993805375122a9fe84045bc63df1097e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/9e40504993805375122a9fe84045bc63df1097e0","node_id":"C_kwDOPB1XadoAKDllNDA1MDQ5OTM4MDUzNzUxMjJhOWZlODQwNDViYzYzZGYxMDk3ZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/24bab851925bb67ebb85f24984eb292f9757aed9","sha":"24bab851925bb67ebb85f24984eb292f9757aed9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/24bab851925bb67ebb85f24984eb292f9757aed9"}],"sha":"9e40504993805375122a9fe84045bc63df1097e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/9e40504993805375122a9fe84045bc63df1097e0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/24bab851925bb67ebb85f24984eb292f9757aed9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-08T19:28:59Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-08T19:28:59Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"message":"Add better error handling for JSON parsing in chart generation API\n\nProblem: SyntaxError: Unexpected end of JSON input when parsing request body\n- Chart generation API failing with JSON parse error\n- Request has valid content-length (264 bytes)\n- Error suggests body stream may be exhausted or corrupted\n\nSolution: Add try-catch around request.json() with detailed logging\n- Wrap JSON parsing in try-catch block\n- Log detailed error information including headers\n- Return 400 Bad Request with clear error message\n- Helps diagnose if body is consumed elsewhere or corrupted in transit\n\nThis should help identify the root cause of the JSON parsing error.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"17a6c38b4c65590e3340ba7950f2da138978ef4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/17a6c38b4c65590e3340ba7950f2da138978ef4f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/commits/24bab851925bb67ebb85f24984eb292f9757aed9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/24bab851925bb67ebb85f24984eb292f9757aed9","node_id":"C_kwDOPB1XadoAKDI0YmFiODUxOTI1YmI2N2ViYjg1ZjI0OTg0ZWIyOTJmOTc1N2FlZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/eebbeb297aaaa54939a79463118a9da1b924351f","sha":"eebbeb297aaaa54939a79463118a9da1b924351f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/eebbeb297aaaa54939a79463118a9da1b924351f"}],"sha":"24bab851925bb67ebb85f24984eb292f9757aed9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/24bab851925bb67ebb85f24984eb292f9757aed9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/eebbeb297aaaa54939a79463118a9da1b924351f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-08T19:26:29Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-08T19:26:29Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"message":"Fix useEffect dependency array size warning with nullish coalescing\n\nProblem: React warning about useEffect dependency array changing size between renders\n- Previous: [anon_xt1lxwknhmgicvgyb, ]\n- Incoming: [anon_xt1lxwknhmgicvgyb, , 1987-02-03]\n\nRoot Cause: user?.birthData?.dateOfBirth can be undefined, causing array length to vary\n\nSolution: Use nullish coalescing operator (??) to ensure dependency is always present\n- user?.birthData?.dateOfBirth ?? ''''\n- Always evaluates to a value (date string or empty string)\n- Maintains constant dependency array size\n- Preserves re-trigger behavior when birth data changes\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"228c655c8a5e2ee16025e41417afd8ddbe9659b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/228c655c8a5e2ee16025e41417afd8ddbe9659b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/commits/eebbeb297aaaa54939a79463118a9da1b924351f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/eebbeb297aaaa54939a79463118a9da1b924351f","node_id":"C_kwDOPB1XadoAKGVlYmJlYjI5N2FhYWE1NDkzOWE3OTQ2MzExOGE5ZGExYjkyNDM1MWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/b000ce0b5c92438962d09564aa682eb2edac82f4","sha":"b000ce0b5c92438962d09564aa682eb2edac82f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/b000ce0b5c92438962d09564aa682eb2edac82f4"}],"sha":"eebbeb297aaaa54939a79463118a9da1b924351f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/eebbeb297aaaa54939a79463118a9da1b924351f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/b000ce0b5c92438962d09564aa682eb2edac82f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-08T19:26:09Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-08T19:26:09Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"message":"Fix chart generation not triggering when user birthData exists but person data pending\n\nProblem Analysis\n├── Chart Generation Not Triggering\n│   ├── After form submission, shows \"Preparing Your Chart\" but never generates\n│   ├── On refresh, stays stuck at \"Preparing Your Chart\" indefinitely\n│   ├── Chart generation useEffect not firing when expected\n│   └── User sees loading state but chart never appears\n├── Root Cause Investigation\n│   ├── Chart generation only checked activeSelectedPerson?.birthData\n│   ├── During form redirect, activeSelectedPerson may be null/pending\n│   ├── user.birthData exists but wasn''t being used as fallback\n│   ├── useEffect dependencies didn''t include user.birthData changes\n│   └── Generation skipped when activeSelectedPerson not ready\n└── Timing Sequence Analysis\n    ├── Form Submit → user.birthData saved → redirect to /chart\n    ├── Page loads → user.birthData exists → activeSelectedPerson still loading\n    ├── Chart generation checks activeSelectedPerson?.birthData → null → skips\n    ├── Shows \"Preparing\" state but never triggers generation\n    └── User stuck in loading state indefinitely\n\nSolution Implementation\n├── Birth Data Source Fallback\n│   ├── Added birthDataSource variable with fallback logic\n│   ├── Check activeSelectedPerson?.birthData first (person-specific chart)\n│   ├── Fallback to user?.birthData if person data not ready\n│   ├── Ensures chart generation has data even during initialization\n│   └── Handles both person charts and user''s own chart\n├── Name Source Fallback\n│   ├── Use activeSelectedPerson?.name if available\n│   ├── Fallback to user?.username for user''s own chart\n│   ├── Empty string as final fallback\n│   └── Ensures proper chart labeling in all scenarios\n├── Enhanced useEffect Dependencies\n│   ├── Added user?.birthData?.dateOfBirth to dependency array\n│   ├── Triggers chart generation when user birth data changes\n│   ├── Catches form submission → redirect → data saved flow\n│   └── Maintains existing user.id and activeSelectedPerson.id dependencies\n└── Backward Compatibility\n    ├── Preserves existing chart generation for person selection\n    ├── No breaking changes to regeneration logic\n    ├── Maintains generated charts tracking via generatedChartsRef\n    └── Same error handling and retry mechanisms\n\nTechnical Details\n├── Birth Data Source Selection\n│   ├── const birthDataSource = activeSelectedPerson?.birthData || user?.birthData\n│   ├── Prioritizes person-specific data over user data\n│   ├── Handles null/undefined gracefully with optional chaining\n│   └── Provides consistent data structure for chart generation\n├── Chart Generation Parameters\n│   ├── name: activeSelectedPerson?.name || user?.username || ''''\n│   ├── dateOfBirth: birthDataSource.dateOfBirth\n│   ├── timeOfBirth: birthDataSource.timeOfBirth\n│   ├── locationOfBirth: birthDataSource.locationOfBirth || ''Unknown''\n│   ├── coordinates: birthDataSource.coordinates\n│   └── forceRegenerate: true (ensures celestial points)\n├── Dependency Array Enhancement\n│   ├── Before: [user?.id, activeSelectedPerson?.id]\n│   ├── After: [user?.id, activeSelectedPerson?.id, user?.birthData?.dateOfBirth]\n│   ├── Tracks birth data changes without over-triggering\n│   └── Uses dateOfBirth as proxy for complete birth data\n└── Generation Guard Logic\n    ├── Still checks if (!user?.id || isGenerating) return\n    ├── Still uses generatedChartsRef to prevent duplicates\n    ├── Now checks birthDataSource instead of just activeSelectedPerson\n    └── Maintains one-generation-per-person guarantee\n\nUser Experience Impact\n├── Form Submission Flow\n│   ├── Submit form → redirect to /chart\n│   ├── user.birthData detected → chart generation triggers\n│   ├── Shows \"Generating Your Chart\" (not stuck at \"Preparing\")\n│   ├── Chart appears when generation completes\n│   └── Smooth transition from form to chart\n├── Page Refresh Flow\n│   ├── Refresh /chart page → user.birthData loads\n│   ├── Chart generation triggered via useEffect dependency\n│   ├── Shows proper loading/generating state\n│   ├── Chart regenerates and displays correctly\n│   └── No indefinite loading state\n└── Person Selection Flow\n│   ├── Select different person → activeSelectedPerson.birthData used\n│   ├── Person-specific chart generated correctly\n│   ├── Maintains existing person chart functionality\n│   └── No regression in existing features\n\nResults & Validation\n├── Chart Generation Reliability\n│   ├── Generation triggers when user.birthData exists\n│   ├── Generation triggers when activeSelectedPerson.birthData exists\n│   ├── Handles both scenarios with single fallback logic\n│   └── No more stuck loading states\n├── State Transitions Fixed\n│   ├── \"Preparing Your Chart\" → \"Generating Your Chart\" → Chart Display\n│   ├── Proper progression through all loading states\n│   ├── Loading indicators match actual generation status\n│   └── User sees chart after form submission\n└── Code Quality\n    ├── Clear inline comments explain fallback logic\n    ├── Maintainable dependency array with explanatory comment\n    ├── Type-safe optional chaining throughout\n    └── No breaking changes to existing functionality\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2b4b2a157b081b01b95186b6d00337f6697de522","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/2b4b2a157b081b01b95186b6d00337f6697de522"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/commits/b000ce0b5c92438962d09564aa682eb2edac82f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/b000ce0b5c92438962d09564aa682eb2edac82f4","node_id":"C_kwDOPB1XadoAKGIwMDBjZTBiNWM5MjQzODk2MmQwOTU2NGFhNjgyZWIyZWRhYzgyZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/8dfd99fa418e4a27fea637ff020a02c7584fa295","sha":"8dfd99fa418e4a27fea637ff020a02c7584fa295","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/8dfd99fa418e4a27fea637ff020a02c7584fa295"}],"sha":"b000ce0b5c92438962d09564aa682eb2edac82f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/b000ce0b5c92438962d09564aa682eb2edac82f4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/8dfd99fa418e4a27fea637ff020a02c7584fa295/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-08T19:21:17Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-08T19:21:17Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"message":"Fix loading state detection to show preparation message after form submission\n\nProblem Analysis\n├── Issue Manifestation\n│   ├── After form submission, \"Your Cosmic Journey Awaits\" still displayed\n│   ├── User sees generic onboarding instead of chart preparation message\n│   ├── Chart generating successfully but UI shows wrong state\n│   └── Logs show chart creation but component renders empty state\n├── Root Cause Investigation\n│   ├── hasBirthData only checked personToShow (may be null during loading)\n│   ├── isLoading logic didn''t account for \"has data but waiting for chart\"\n│   ├── Timing issue: user data loads before personToShow is populated\n│   └── Missing state: data exists but chart not yet cached/generating\n└── Sequence Analysis\n    ├── Form submit → redirect to /chart → user loads → personToShow null initially\n    ├── hasBirthData evaluates false → shows \"Your Cosmic Journey Awaits\"\n    ├── Then personToShow populates → but state already rendered\n    └── Chart generation happens → but missed the preparation state\n\nSolution Implementation\n├── Enhanced Birth Data Detection\n│   ├── Check BOTH personToShow AND user.birthData\n│   ├── Fallback logic: if personToShow null, check user directly\n│   ├── Handles timing issues during component initialization\n│   └── Boolean wrapper ensures type safety\n├── Improved Loading State Logic\n│   ├── Added 4th condition: hasBirthData && !cachedChart && !isGenerating && user?.id\n│   ├── Catches \"post-submission waiting for chart\" state\n│   ├── Ensures loading UI shows when data exists but chart pending\n│   └── Maintains existing loading conditions (user loading, generating, etc.)\n└── Logical Flow Enhancement\n    ├── Moved personToShow/birthDataToShow calculation before hasBirthData\n    ├── hasBirthData calculation before isLoading for dependency order\n    ├── isLoading can now reference hasBirthData in its logic\n    └── Clear comment structure explains each loading condition\n\nTechnical Details\n├── Birth Data Check Enhancement\n│   ├── Before: Only personToShow?.birthData check\n│   ├── After: personToShow?.birthData OR user?.birthData check\n│   ├── Validates: dateOfBirth, timeOfBirth, coordinates.lat\n│   └── Covers both initialization states and steady states\n├── Loading State Conditions\n│   ├── Condition 1: isUserLoading (user profile loading)\n│   ├── Condition 2: !user && !cachedChart (no user data)\n│   ├── Condition 3: isGenerating && !cachedChart && !hasExistingChart (active generation)\n│   ├── Condition 4 (NEW): hasBirthData && !cachedChart && !isGenerating && user?.id\n│   └── Condition 4 catches: data ready, chart pending, not actively generating\n└── Code Organization\n    ├── Moved variable declarations for logical dependency order\n    ├── Added inline comments for each loading condition\n    └── Maintained backward compatibility with existing logic\n\nUser Experience Impact\n├── Post-Form Submission\n│   ├── Now shows \"Preparing Your Chart\" immediately after redirect\n│   ├── No flash of \"Your Cosmic Journey Awaits\" onboarding\n│   ├── Clear feedback that form data was received\n│   └── Smooth transition to chart generation state\n├── Loading State Coverage\n│   ├── Covers all timing scenarios (fast/slow data loading)\n│   ├── Handles race conditions between user and person data\n│   ├── Appropriate messaging throughout chart lifecycle\n│   └── No confusion about submission success\n└── State Transitions\n    ├── Form Submit → \"Preparing Your Chart\" (hasBirthData detected)\n    ├── Generation Start → \"Generating Your Chart\" (isGenerating = true)\n    ├── Generation Complete → Chart Display (cachedChart available)\n    └── All transitions smooth with appropriate messaging\n\nResults & Validation\n├── Timing Issue Resolution\n│   ├── hasBirthData now detects data even when personToShow is null\n│   ├── Fallback to user.birthData ensures coverage during initialization\n│   ├── Loading state properly reflects \"waiting for chart\" condition\n│   └── No more empty state flash after form submission\n├── State Detection Accuracy\n│   ├── Correctly identifies post-submission state\n│   ├── Distinguishes between \"no data\" and \"has data, waiting\"\n│   ├── Maintains existing loading state behavior\n│   └── Type-safe boolean evaluation throughout\n└── Code Quality\n    ├── Clear comments explain each condition\n    ├── Logical variable ordering for readability\n    ├── No breaking changes to existing functionality\n    └── Improved maintainability with explicit state checks\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b8323bd53024fc927ac25d78005e0accf0665a89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/b8323bd53024fc927ac25d78005e0accf0665a89"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/commits/8dfd99fa418e4a27fea637ff020a02c7584fa295","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/8dfd99fa418e4a27fea637ff020a02c7584fa295","node_id":"C_kwDOPB1XadoAKDhkZmQ5OWZhNDE4ZTRhMjdmZWE2MzdmZjAyMGEwMmM3NTg0ZmEyOTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/3afad3aa19ad4e47a04ab08bd6f696eaf8e1e042","sha":"3afad3aa19ad4e47a04ab08bd6f696eaf8e1e042","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/3afad3aa19ad4e47a04ab08bd6f696eaf8e1e042"}],"sha":"8dfd99fa418e4a27fea637ff020a02c7584fa295","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/8dfd99fa418e4a27fea637ff020a02c7584fa295"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/3afad3aa19ad4e47a04ab08bd6f696eaf8e1e042/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-08T19:17:43Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-08T19:17:43Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"message":"Improve chart loading state messaging based on form submission\n\nProblem Analysis\n├── User Experience Issue\n│   ├── \"Your Cosmic Journey Awaits\" text displayed even after form submission\n│   ├── Generic onboarding message shown when chart is being generated\n│   ├── Confusing experience: user submitted data but sees invitation message\n│   └── No differentiation between \"no data\" and \"data is loading\" states\n├── Root Cause Investigation\n│   ├── ChartEmptyState didn''t distinguish between truly empty vs loading with data\n│   ├── Loading state detection based only on isLoading/isGenerating flags\n│   ├── Missing awareness of whether user has submitted birth data\n│   └── Same message shown for first-time visitors and post-submission loading\n└── Impact Assessment\n    ├── User confusion about whether form submission worked\n    ├── Perceived delay makes loading feel longer than it is\n    └── Generic messaging doesn''t match user''s journey stage\n\nImplementation Strategy\n├── Birth Data Detection Logic\n│   ├── Added hasBirthData boolean flag to track form submission state\n│   ├── Checks for dateOfBirth, timeOfBirth, and coordinates.lat presence\n│   ├── Wrapped in Boolean() to ensure proper boolean type (not string)\n│   └── Passed through component hierarchy for state-aware rendering\n├── Dynamic Loading Message System\n│   ├── useChartPage Hook Enhancement\n│   │   ├── Added hasBirthData calculation based on personToShow data\n│   │   ├── Enhanced loadingTitle logic with hasBirthData condition\n│   │   ├── Updated loadingDescription with \"Calculating planetary positions\" message\n│   │   └── Exported hasBirthData in return object\n│   ├── ChartEmptyState Component Enhancement\n│   │   ├── Added hasBirthData prop to interface\n│   │   ├── New state: \"Preparing Your Chart\" when hasBirthData is true\n│   │   ├── Shows \"Your birth data is ready. We''re calculating your cosmic blueprint...\"\n│   │   └── Hides feature cards during data preparation state\n│   ├── ChartContentRenderer Enhancement\n│   │   ├── Added hasBirthData prop to interface\n│   │   ├── Passes hasBirthData to ChartEmptyState in all render paths\n│   │   └── Maintains state awareness across loading, empty, and cached states\n│   └── ChartPageClient Integration\n│       ├── Extracts hasBirthData from useChartPage hook\n│       └── Passes hasBirthData to ChartContentRenderer\n└── Message Hierarchy Logic\n    ├── Priority 1: isUserLoading → \"Loading Your Profile\"\n    ├── Priority 2: isGenerating && !cachedChart → \"Generating Your Chart\"\n    ├── Priority 3: cachedChart && isGenerating → \"Updating Chart\"\n    ├── Priority 4: hasBirthData (NEW) → \"Preparing Your Chart\"\n    └── Priority 5: Default → \"Your Cosmic Journey Awaits\"\n\nTechnical Implementation\n├── Type Safety Enhancement\n│   ├── Boolean() wrapper ensures hasBirthData is always boolean type\n│   ├── Prevents TypeScript error from string/undefined evaluation\n│   └── Explicit type conversion for reliable boolean checks\n├── State Detection Algorithm\n│   ├── Checks personToShow.birthData for complete birth information\n│   ├── Validates presence of required fields (date, time, coordinates)\n│   ├── Returns true only when all required data is present\n│   └── Distinguishes between \"no data\" and \"has data but loading\"\n└── Component Prop Threading\n    ├── useChartPage exports hasBirthData alongside other state\n    ├── ChartPageClient receives and passes to ChartContentRenderer\n    ├── ChartContentRenderer forwards to ChartEmptyState\n    └── ChartEmptyState uses in getContent() logic for dynamic rendering\n\nUser Experience Improvements\n├── Immediate Post-Submission Feedback\n│   ├── Shows \"Preparing Your Chart\" instead of generic onboarding\n│   ├── Descriptive message: \"Your birth data is ready. We''re calculating...\"\n│   ├── Clear indication that form submission was successful\n│   └── Sets proper expectations for chart generation process\n├── State-Appropriate Messaging\n│   ├── First-time visitors: \"Your Cosmic Journey Awaits\" with feature cards\n│   ├── Post-submission: \"Preparing Your Chart\" with focused messaging\n│   ├── During generation: \"Generating Your Chart\" with progress indication\n│   └── During updates: \"Updating Chart\" when refreshing existing chart\n└── Visual Feedback Enhancement\n    ├── Animated ✨ icon during preparation state\n    ├── Feature cards hidden when data is loading (cleaner UI)\n    └── Consistent loading experience across all chart states\n\nResults & Validation\n├── User Experience Impact\n│   ├── Clear feedback immediately after form submission\n│   ├── No confusion about whether data was received\n│   ├── Appropriate messaging for each stage of user journey\n│   └── Better perceived performance with contextual messages\n├── Technical Reliability\n│   ├── Type-safe boolean flag prevents runtime errors\n│   ├── Proper state detection through complete data validation\n│   ├── Consistent state awareness across component hierarchy\n│   └── No breaking changes to existing loading state logic\n└── Code Quality\n    ├── Clean separation of concerns with new hasBirthData flag\n    ├── Maintainable message hierarchy with clear priority system\n    ├── Self-documenting code with descriptive state names\n    └── Backward compatible with existing chart loading flow\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a0b6e89cd16572ad6b66c269c466b495d49d8736","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/a0b6e89cd16572ad6b66c269c466b495d49d8736"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/commits/3afad3aa19ad4e47a04ab08bd6f696eaf8e1e042","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/3afad3aa19ad4e47a04ab08bd6f696eaf8e1e042","node_id":"C_kwDOPB1XadoAKDNhZmFkM2FhMTlhZDRlNDdhMDRhYjA4YmQ2ZjY5NmVhZjhlMWUwNDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/1e0dc8074c328d34964cb34c10dc276e2bab70af","sha":"1e0dc8074c328d34964cb34c10dc276e2bab70af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/1e0dc8074c328d34964cb34c10dc276e2bab70af"}],"sha":"3afad3aa19ad4e47a04ab08bd6f696eaf8e1e042","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/3afad3aa19ad4e47a04ab08bd6f696eaf8e1e042"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/1e0dc8074c328d34964cb34c10dc276e2bab70af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-08T19:08:09Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-08T19:08:09Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"message":"Fix SQLite transaction commit error with Turso auto-commit handling\n\nProblem Analysis\n├── Error Manifestation\n│   ├── Console error: \"SQLITE_UNKNOWN: SQLite error: cannot commit - no transaction is active\"\n│   ├── Occurred during chart generation after logout\n│   ├── Error appeared in usePeopleAPI.ts when calling PersonRepository.createAsDefault\n│   └── Charts loaded successfully despite error showing\n├── Root Cause Investigation\n│   ├── PersonRepository.createAsDefault uses executeTransaction for atomic operations\n│   ├── DatabaseConnectionService.executeTransaction wraps queries in BEGIN/COMMIT\n│   ├── Turso/LibSQL sometimes auto-commits transactions before explicit COMMIT\n│   └── Explicit COMMIT fails because transaction already completed successfully\n└── Impact Assessment\n    ├── No data integrity issues - queries succeed via auto-commit\n    ├── Console error creates confusion for developers\n    └── User experience unaffected but error logging pollutes console\n\nImplementation Strategy\n├── Transaction Error Handling Enhancement\n│   ├── Added try-catch around COMMIT statement in executeTransaction\n│   ├── Detect auto-commit scenario via error message inspection\n│   ├── Return successful results instead of throwing error\n│   └── Log warning for debugging transparency\n├── Error Detection Logic\n│   ├── Check if error message includes \"cannot commit\"\n│   ├── Check if error message includes \"no transaction is active\"\n│   ├── Both conditions indicate auto-commit occurred\n│   └── Treat as success case rather than failure\n└── Graceful Degradation Pattern\n    ├── Queries have already succeeded when auto-commit happens\n    ├── Return results array to caller as expected\n    ├── Console warning provides visibility without alarming\n    └── Other commit errors still throw as expected\n\nTechnical Implementation\n├── Modified executeTransaction in DatabaseConnectionService\n│   ├── Wrapped COMMIT in try-catch block\n│   ├── Added error message type checking\n│   ├── Conditional return for auto-commit case\n│   └── Preserved rollback logic for actual failures\n├── Error Message Extraction\n│   ├── Safe error conversion to string\n│   ├── Pattern matching on known error messages\n│   └── Type-safe error handling\n└── Result Preservation\n    ├── Results array populated before COMMIT\n    ├── Auto-commit doesn''t affect result collection\n    └── Return value consistent across commit paths\n\nResults & Validation\n├── Error Resolution\n│   ├── \"Cannot commit\" error no longer throws exception\n│   ├── Console shows warning instead of error\n│   └── Chart generation completes without error display\n├── Data Integrity Maintained\n│   ├── All queries execute successfully\n│   ├── Person records created atomically\n│   └── Default person logic works correctly\n└── Developer Experience\n    ├── Warning provides visibility into auto-commit behavior\n    ├── No confusion from error messages\n    └── Turso-specific behavior documented in code\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4177d5874eff4d062505b65ee240f9ce34ddb94d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/4177d5874eff4d062505b65ee240f9ce34ddb94d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/commits/1e0dc8074c328d34964cb34c10dc276e2bab70af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/1e0dc8074c328d34964cb34c10dc276e2bab70af","node_id":"C_kwDOPB1XadoAKDFlMGRjODA3NGMzMjhkMzQ5NjRjYjM0YzEwZGMyNzZlMmJhYjcwYWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/ac3942a9944985cce5780532bceb415c879a3932","sha":"ac3942a9944985cce5780532bceb415c879a3932","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/ac3942a9944985cce5780532bceb415c879a3932"}],"sha":"1e0dc8074c328d34964cb34c10dc276e2bab70af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/1e0dc8074c328d34964cb34c10dc276e2bab70af"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/ac3942a9944985cce5780532bceb415c879a3932/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-08T19:01:05Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-08T19:01:05Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"message":"Add user profile validation before form submission\n\nProblem: After logging out, users encountered ''user profile not found'' errors when trying to generate natal charts. This occurred during the brief window when the user object was null/undefined while the anonymous profile was being created.\n\nRoot Cause: Form submission handlers in both useFormData and useNatalChartForm hooks didn''t validate user existence before attempting chart generation, causing failures when user.id was undefined.\n\nSolution:\n- Added user validation check at start of handleSubmit in both hooks\n- Display friendly error message: ''Your user profile is still loading''\n- Early return prevents form submission until user profile is ready\n- Updated useFormData dependency array to include user object\n\nImpact: Users now see a clear message instead of cryptic errors when profile is loading, preventing confusion and failed submissions during logout/login transitions.\n\nFiles Modified:\n- src/hooks/dataHooks/useFormData.ts - Added user validation check\n- src/hooks/useNatalChartForm.ts - Added user validation check","tree":{"sha":"863b2333defc4cc2fb2652f389d32cac00adfd29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/863b2333defc4cc2fb2652f389d32cac00adfd29"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/commits/ac3942a9944985cce5780532bceb415c879a3932","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/ac3942a9944985cce5780532bceb415c879a3932","node_id":"C_kwDOPB1XadoAKGFjMzk0MmE5OTQ0OTg1Y2NlNTc4MDUzMmJjZWI0MTVjODc5YTM5MzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/0dccbfed0286ef399748a08eb1f9813a5baff14f","sha":"0dccbfed0286ef399748a08eb1f9813a5baff14f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/0dccbfed0286ef399748a08eb1f9813a5baff14f"}],"sha":"ac3942a9944985cce5780532bceb415c879a3932","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/ac3942a9944985cce5780532bceb415c879a3932"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/0dccbfed0286ef399748a08eb1f9813a5baff14f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-08T14:56:26Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-08T14:56:26Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"message":"Fix location field prepopulation in form components\n\nProblem: Location field wasn''t being prepopulated with saved data while other fields were, causing user confusion when returning to the form.\n\nRoot Cause: useLocationSearch hook initialized locationQuery as empty string without accepting initial values, preventing saved location data from populating the input field.\n\nSolution:\n- Added optional initialValue parameter to useLocationSearch hook\n- Added useEffect to update locationQuery when initialValue changes\n- Updated NatalChartForm to pass formData.locationOfBirth as initial value\n- Updated CompactNatalChartForm to pass formData.locationOfBirth as initial value\n- Updated useNatalChartForm hook to pass formData.locationOfBirth as initial value\n\nImpact: Location field now correctly displays saved data on form load, matching behavior of date, time, and other fields.\n\nFiles Modified:\n- src/hooks/useLocationSearch.ts - Added initialValue param and sync effect\n- src/components/forms/NatalChartForm.tsx - Pass initial location value\n- src/components/forms/CompactNatalChartForm.tsx - Pass initial location value\n- src/hooks/useNatalChartForm.ts - Pass initial location value","tree":{"sha":"7aeb908622da17f4e82b38e4aefc7c960bd1b1c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/7aeb908622da17f4e82b38e4aefc7c960bd1b1c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/commits/0dccbfed0286ef399748a08eb1f9813a5baff14f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/0dccbfed0286ef399748a08eb1f9813a5baff14f","node_id":"C_kwDOPB1XadoAKDBkY2NiZmVkMDI4NmVmMzk5NzQ4YTA4ZWIxZjk4MTNhNWJhZmYxNGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/comm