\n- Reduced Chart Generation & Persistence section from ~150 lines to ~25 lines\n- Condensed tree map architecture from ~222 lines to ~17 lines (emoji tree → plain summary)\n- Simplified modular refactoring section from ~150 lines to ~20 lines\n- Total reduction: 466 lines removed (19.5% smaller: 2394 → 1928 lines)\n- Preserved all critical technical information and implementation details\n- Maintained architecture documentation and key findings","tree":{"sha":"0b46203dd5954e253357fd19be729f2eaa42546f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/0b46203dd5954e253357fd19be729f2eaa42546f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/commits/472c5cbe77b572d2ba1388a59e23155417c0dd55","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/472c5cbe77b572d2ba1388a59e23155417c0dd55","node_id":"C_kwDOPB1XadoAKDQ3MmM1Y2JlNzdiNTcyZDJiYTE