umentation Updates:\n├── New Section: Round 28 - Modular Architecture\n│   ├── Problem Statement: 1533-line monolithic file\n│   ├── Solution Architecture: 7 focused modules\n│   ├── Architecture Benefits: 95% size reduction, testability, maintainability\n│   └── Technical Implementation Details: All 7 new services documented\n├── Service Documentation\n│   ├── Constants Module: Centralized astrological constants\n│   ├── Type Definitions: Consolidated type system\n│   ├── Calculation Service: Planetary position calculations\n│   ├── House System Service: Placidus implementation\n│   ├── Celestial Points Service: Special point calculations\n│   ├── Rendering Service: SVG chart generation\n│   └── Main Orchestration: Clean service composition\n└── Impact Analysis\n    ├── Chart Sharing Benefits: Improved reliability and testability\n    ├── Files Created: 7 new modular service files\n    ├── Technical Verification: Backward compatibility maintained\n    └── Production Readiness: Debug logs removed\n\nCompletes documentation for CODE_ARCHITECTURE_PROTOCOL.md refactoring.","tree":{"sha":"0b25aa27a0cb330a3727a9a141c5940f5da9243a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/0b25aa27a0cb330a3727a9a141c5940f5da9243a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/commits/686780b3c84d6de7f626624778d417ee7d8a6cf2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/686780b3c84d6de7f626624778d417ee7d8a6cf2","node_id":"C_kwDOPB1XadoAKDY4Njc4MGIzYzg0ZDZkZTdmNjI2NjI0Nzc4ZDQxN2VlN2Q4YTZjZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/b5afc4c5cba9ff56e60305532b2d83cdb49807d1","sha":"b5afc4c5cba9ff56e60305532b2d83cdb49807d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/b5afc4c5cba9ff56e60305532b2d83cdb49807d1"}],"sha":"686780b3c84d6de7f626624778d417ee7d8a6cf2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/686780b3c84d6de7f626624778d417ee7d8a6cf2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/b5afc4c5cba9ff56e60305532b2d83cdb49807d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-08T14:15:35Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-08T14:15:35Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"message":"Refactor natalChart.ts into modular service architecture\n\nApplied CODE_ARCHITECTURE_PROTOCOL to decompose monolithic natal chart generation.\n\nArchitecture Changes:\n├── Core Module Extraction\n│   ├── src/constants/astrological.ts - Astrological constants (SIGNS, PLANETS, ASPECTS)\n│   ├── src/types/astrology.ts - Type definitions (PlanetPosition, NatalChartData)\n│   ├── src/utils/formatters/astroFormatters.ts - Formatting utilities\n│   └── src/utils/natalChart.ts - Main orchestration module (85 lines, was 1533)\n├── Business Services Layer\n│   ├── astroCalculationService.ts - Planetary position calculations\n│   ├── celestialPointsService.ts - Special point calculations (Lilith, Chiron, Nodes)\n│   └── houseSystemService.ts - Placidus house system implementation\n└── Data Services Layer\n    └── chartRenderingService.ts - SVG chart generation\n\nBenefits:\n- 95% reduction in main module size (1533 → 85 lines)\n- Clear separation of concerns (calculation vs rendering vs orchestration)\n- Improved testability with isolated services\n- Maintained backward compatibility via re-exports\n- Enhanced maintainability with focused modules\n\nAdditional Changes:\n- Removed debug console logs from ChartInterpretation.tsx\n- Updated CHART_SHARING_DOCUMENTATION.md with refactoring notes","tree":{"sha":"ed376c2d406e93bcb38646aad770e14caaddfba9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/ed376c2d406e93bcb38646aad770e14caaddfba9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbi