ps://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/6ffdb11da5b9eda8800cd275b1c87f9450b23ea4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-14T19:32:46Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-14T19:32:46Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"message":"Apply CODE_ARCHITECTURE_PROTOCOL: Refactor astrocartography geocoding to modular service architecture\n\nRefactoring Implementation\n├── Service Layer Architecture\n│   ├── Created GeocodingService (businessServices)\n│   │   ├── Coordinate validation and processing logic\n│   │   ├── Fallback coordinate resolution system\n│   │   ├── Integration with centralized configuration\n│   │   └── Error handling with detailed logging\n│   ├── Created CoordinateValidators (utils/validators)\n│   │   ├── TypeScript type guards for coordinates\n│   │   ├── Validation utilities for UI components\n│   │   ├── Precision analysis and sanitization\n│   │   └── Birth data structure validation\n│   └── Created GeocodingConfig (config)\n│       ├── 25+ worldwide fallback locations with priority system\n│       ├── Philippines (Zamboanga, Manila, Cebu, Davao + 3 more)\n│       ├── International locations (USA, UK, Canada, Australia, Japan)\n│       └── Configuration validation and statistics\n├── Code Duplication Elimination\n│   ├── Extracted 150+ lines of duplicate coordinate logic\n│   ├── Centralized hardcoded fallback coordinates\n│   ├── Consolidated validation patterns across components\n│   └── Single source of truth for coordinate processing\n├── Integration Layer Refactoring\n│   ├── Updated useAstrocartographyData.ts (reduced from 150+ to 40 lines)\n│   ├── Clean service integration with error handling\n│   ├── Enhanced logging with coordinate source tracking\n│   └── Maintained backward compatibility for existing functionality\n└── Testing and Validation Infrastructure\n    ├── Created comprehensive test suite (geocodingServiceTest.ts)\n    ├── Browser console test runner for real-world scenarios\n    ├── TypeScript compilation validation (PASS)\n    ├── ESLint quality checks (PASS)\n    ├── Next.js production build verification (PASS)\n    └── Functional testing for all coordinate scenarios (PASS)\n\nTechnical Resolution\n├── Fixed empty coordinates issue for \"Zamboanga del Sur, Philippines\"\n├── Implemented graceful fallback chain: original → fallback → error\n├── Enhanced coordinate validation with detailed error messages\n├── Added priority-based location matching system\n└── Created extensible architecture for future location additions\n\nArchitectural Benefits\n├── Single Responsibility Principle: Each service has one clear purpose\n├── Maintainability: Single configuration point for location management\n├── Reusability: Services available across entire application\n├── Type Safety: Comprehensive TypeScript validation throughout\n└── Performance: Eliminated code duplication, optimized processing\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"51e1f0261ce90e08ae0d055f3bcc8cdd241a014f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/51e1f0261ce90e08ae0d055f3bcc8cdd241a014f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/commits/6ffdb11da5b9eda8800cd275b1c87f9450b23ea4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://g