cific interpretations instead of cached natal content\n    ├── Clean separation between natal and electional chart systems\n    └── Maintains performance while ensuring data accuracy\n\nMajor Aspects Section Enhancement:\n├── Aspect Count Restoration\n│   ├── Added missing counts to harmonious/challenging/neutral buttons\n│   ├── Implemented aspectCounts memo for efficient count calculation\n│   ├── Enhanced typeOptions interface with count property\n│   └── Styled count badges with proper selected/unselected states\n└── User Experience Improvement\n    ├── Clear visibility of aspect distribution across energy types\n    ├── Consistent styling matching existing design patterns\n    └── Responsive count display for mobile and desktop\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dbed579bc04416ecb67cfd5e1b2fc5d9ac1ae9ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/dbed579bc04416ecb67cfd5e1b2fc5d9ac1ae9ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/commits/55875514da513f98384d3e5d0634aea33ca608f5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred