"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-06T02:56:55Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"message":"Improve celestial point calculations using astronomy-engine\n\n- Updated Black Moon Lilith calculation to use SearchLunarApsis for precise lunar apogee events\n- Enhanced Lunar Nodes calculation with SearchMoonNode for accurate node crossings\n- Implemented proper Chiron calculation using J2000.0 orbital elements with Kepler''s equation\n- Verified Part of Fortune calculation accuracy with correct day/night birth formulas\n- Added ''centaur'' type to pointType union for proper TypeScript support\n- All calculations now match astronomy-engine precision standards\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"75c911bf3a64b2f7203bbe743c5f45f483704179","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/75c911bf3a64b2f7203bbe743c5f45f483704179"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/commits/93555c1641a21a3cbe170e47895b8448c11c7f3d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/93555c1641a21a3cbe170e47895b8448c11c7f3d","node_id":"C_kwDOPB1XadoAKDkzNTU1YzE2NDFhMjFhM2NiZTE3MGU0Nzg5NWI4NDQ4YzExYzdmM2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/76ef2174b9d08a5311cf0ebb591140717a6e9377","sha":"76ef2174b9d08a5311cf0ebb591140717a6e9377","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/76ef2174b9d08a5311cf0ebb591140717a6e9377"}],"sha":"93555c1641a21a3cbe170e47895b8448c11c7f3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/93555c1641a21a3cbe170e47895b8448c11c7f3d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/76ef2174b9d08a5311cf0ebb591140717a6e9377/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-06T01:53:14Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-06T01:53:14Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"message":"Major chart architecture refactoring and performance improvements\n\nArchitecture Changes:\n- Migrated to micro-frontend chart modules with lazy loading\n- Implemented ChartShell container for optimized rendering\n- Created modular chart components (ChartCore, ChartActions, ChartInterpretation)\n- Added intersection observer for performance monitoring\n\nPerformance Optimizations:\n- Removed all timeouts from database connections and circuit breaker\n- Eliminated artificial delays in chart loading and caching\n- Implemented immediate retry logic for better resilience\n- Optimized connection pool without idle timeouts\n\nFeature Additions:\n- Added comprehensive chart section controls (visibility, filtering, preferences)\n- Implemented aspect filtering by category and type\n- Added chart appearance customization (themes, sizes, visual elements)\n- Created premium feature access control with section filtering\n\nCode Quality:\n- Fixed all TypeScript and ESLint errors\n- Cleaned up unused natal library files\n- Improved type safety across chart components\n- Enhanced error handling and fallback mechanisms\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"47d8d03fdbbac0af5ebc20784cf225f18d5fc0f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/47d8d03fdbbac0af5ebc20784cf225f18d5fc0f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/commits/76ef2174b9d08a5311cf0ebb591140717a6e9377","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","follow