tps://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/1650ac550decd134db8ec8763a9719ad04c8fd4d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-05T18:23:57Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-05T18:23:57Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"message":"Remove all timeouts and add section filtering controls to chart interpretation\n\n## Timeout Removal\n- Remove acquireTimeoutMs and idleTimeoutMs from database connection pools\n- Remove setTimeout delays from database retry logic - retry immediately on failure\n- Simplify circuit breaker to operate on failure count only (no recovery timeout)\n- Remove unused timeout references from chart caching hooks\n- Connection validity now only checks maxLifetimeMs, not idle time\n\n## Section Filtering Controls\n- Add ChartSectionControls component with visibility toggles for chart sections\n- Add ChartAspectFilters for filtering aspects by category and type\n- Add ChartPreferences for chart appearance customization\n- Integrate controls into active ChartInterpretation module\n- Fix import in NatalChartDisplay to use new module with controls\n- Support premium/free section filtering with proper access control\n\n## Benefits\n- Database operations complete naturally without artificial time limits\n- Chart calculations can run as long as needed\n- More resilient to slow operations\n- Users can now customize which chart sections they want to see\n- Premium features properly gated while free sections always visible\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b3102fa0a00550fb5037a786b5bb2b94d1892af4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/b3102fa0a00550fb5037a786b5bb2b94d1892af4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/commits/1650ac550decd134db8ec8763a9719ad04c8fd4d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/1650ac550decd134db8ec8763a9719ad04c8fd4d","node_id":"C_kwDOPB1XadoAKDE2NTBhYzU1MGRlY2QxMzRkYjhlYzg3NjNhOTcxOWFkMDRjOGZkNGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/ff5eb830efb4fe16e4df6b5c45dcd274b1c4bb74","sha":"ff5eb830efb4fe16e4df6b5c45dcd274b1c4bb74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/ff5eb830efb4fe16e4df6b5c45