jY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/43f5a626d2a369c2e23407478d28235cbcdd696c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-28T15:24:26Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-28T15:24:26Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"message":"Implement multi-layer chart security hardening with contamination prevention\n\n- Add cache versioning system (v3) to invalidate old contaminated entries\n- Enhance contamination detection with birth data validation\n- Add render-time protection as final security layer\n- Implement automatic full cache cleanup on contamination detection\n- Add session-based legacy cache removal\n- Fix TypeScript error in useSharedCharts mock result\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7f51b3327653f47004db3157a293b6b32ca404bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/7f51b3327653f47004db3157a293b6b32ca404bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/commits/43f5a626d2a369c2e23407478d28235cbcdd696c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/43f5a626d2a369c2e23407478d28235cbcdd696c","node_id":"C_kwDOPB1XadoAKDQzZjVhNjI2ZDJhMzY5YzJlMjM0MDc0NzhkMjgyMzVjYmNkZDY5NmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commit/8e683972b295d2564dded52e95f8b05c97aea11a","sha":"8e683972b295d2564dded52e95f8b05c97aea11a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/8e683972b295d2564dded52e95f8b05c97aea11a"}],"sha":"43f5a626d2a369c2e23407478d28235cbcdd696c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/43f5a626d2a369c2e23407478d28235cbcdd696c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/8e683972b295d2564dded52e95f8b05c97aea11a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-28T14:49:51Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-28T14:49:51Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"message":"CRITICAL FIX: Prevent anonymous users from seeing admin charts\n\nAnonymous User Chart Security Fix\n├── Root Cause Analysis\n│   ├── defaultPerson lookup was not filtering by userId\n│   │   ├── usePeopleAPI.ts line 37: people.find(p => p.isDefault)\n│   │   ├── peopleStore.ts line 54: people.find(p => p.isDefault)\n│   │   └── Missing user ownership validation\n│   ├── Chart cache fallback logic security hole\n│   │   ├── useChartCache.ts line 32: defaultPerson?.birthData fallback\n│   │   ├── Anonymous users getting admin''s birth data\n│   │   └── Cross-user data leakage vulnerability\n│   └── Person selection priority chain weakness\n│       ├── useChartCache.ts line 28: selectedPerson || defaultPerson\n│       ├── No user ownership verification in fallback chain\n│       └── Admin''s default person shown to anonymous users\n├── Security Fixes Applied\n│   ├── Enhanced usePeopleAPI.ts defaultPerson computation\n│   │   ├── Added userId filter: p.isDefault && p.userId === user?.id\n│   │   ├── Prevents cross-user default person access\n│   │   └── Maintains user data isolation\n│   ├── Secured useChartCache.ts data selection logic\n│   │   ├── Added user ownership check: defaultPerson?.userId === user?.id\n│   │   ├── Applied to both activePerson and activePersonData\n│   │   └── Prevents unauthorized birth data access\n│   └── Multi-layer protection implementation\n│       ├── API layer already has proper userId filtering\n│       ├── Database layer has user isolation\n│       └── Frontend hooks now enforce ownership validation\n└── Impact & Validation\n    ├── Anonymous users can no longer see admin charts\n    ├── Each user''s data remains isolated\n    ├── Default person selection respects user boundaries\n    ├── Chart cache only uses user''s own data\n    └── No breaking changes to existing functionality\n\n🔒 Security vulnerability patched - user data isolation restored\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c19a21a0ed02142f6fcb293e74f180b4edba0107","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/c19a21a0ed02142f6fcb293e74f180b4edba0107"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/commits/8e683972b295d2564dded52e95f8b05c97aea11a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeiste