Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-28T14:34:41Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"message":"Clean up duplicate files and consolidate form architecture\n\nDuplicate File Cleanup & Code Organization\n├── Backup and Old File Removal\n│   ├── Removed ChartQuickActions.old.tsx (outdated implementation)\n│   ├── Removed SeedingTab.tsx.backup (backup file)\n│   └── Removed page_backup.tsx (guide page backup)\n├── Form Component Consolidation\n│   ├── Removed duplicate CompactNatalChartForm.tsx\n│   │   ├── Kept V2 version with unified useNatalChartForm hook\n│   │   ├── Better separation of concerns\n│   │   └── Consistent with architectural patterns\n│   ├── Removed duplicate NatalChartForm.tsx\n│   │   ├── Kept V2 version with cleaner implementation\n│   │   ├── Eliminated redundant interface definitions\n│   │   └── Reduced code complexity from 200+ to 50 lines\n│   └── Removed unused useCompactNatalChartForm.ts hook\n├── Type System Enhancement\n│   ├── Created consolidated src/types/forms.ts\n│   │   ├── Centralized NatalChartFormData interface\n│   │   ├── Added FormValidation interface\n│   │   └── Defined LocationFormData and DateTimeFormData\n│   ├── Updated import statements across codebase\n│   │   ├── Fixed src/app/HomePageClient.tsx imports\n│   │   ├── Fixed src/app/[username]/UserProfilePageClient.tsx imports\n│   │   ├── Fixed src/components/reusable/NatalChartSection.tsx imports\n│   │   └── Updated src/components/charts/components/PersonFormModal.tsx\n│   └── Resolved type compatibility issues\n│       ├── Fixed Location vs LocationOption interface conflicts\n│       ├── Updated useLocationSearch hook to use LocationOption\n│       └── Maintained backward compatibility\n└── Bug Fixes and Error Resolution\n    ├── Fixed Next.js 15 async params errors in route.ts\n    │   ├── Resolved id scope issues in catch blocks\n    │   ├── Updated error logging to remove template literals\n    │   └── Maintained proper error handling\n    ├── Fixed PersonService.ts variable scope error\n    │   ├── Moved sanitizedData declaration to function scope\n    │   ├── Preserved error handling logic\n    │   └── Fixed unique constraint violation handling\n    └── Resolved TypeScript compilation errors\n        ├── Fixed formData?.name access on never type\n        ├── Updated useChartOperations type handling\n        └── Achieved clean TypeScript and ESLint builds\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1608e877de223dff54348f655163382324514e52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/1608e877de223dff54348f655163382324514e52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/commits/f436386b5280014431006fc5894ff68a630ede2e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10895664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julesmeister","id":10895664,"login":"julesmeister","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk1NjY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julesmeister","user_view_type":"public"},"html_ur