_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/commits/faf8418b6ef59c651862761d3371f1d52d660abd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-22T19:05:14Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-22T19:05:14Z","email":"jackconsolidated@gmail.com","name":"Jules Lee"},"message":"Calibrate AI humanization intensity and fix reply scheduling system\n\n## Humanization Intensity Calibration\n- Removed frequent \"the → teh\" typo replacement (user feedback)\n- Fixed sentence-level humanization to apply to all sentences, not just first\n- Reduced humanization probabilities:\n  - Typos: 1.5x → 0.7x intensity multiplier, max 2 typos instead of 4\n  - Hesitation markers: 0.8 → 0.3 probability\n  - Self-corrections: 0.6 → 0.25 probability\n  - Emotional reactions: 0.7 → 0.3 probability\n  - Letter repetition: 0.8 → 0.35 probability\n  - Trailing thoughts: 0.7 → 0.3 probability\n- Lowered base intensity levels across writing styles (0.6-0.9 → 0.2-0.6 range)\n\n## Reply Scheduling System Fixes\n- Fixed comment processing to include proper seeding system fields:\n  - Added createdAt field (current time when reply created)\n  - Added scheduledDelay field (1 hour to 7 days, staggered by 30min)\n  - Added isTemporary flag for preview system compatibility\n- Updated both AI-processed and fallback reply generation paths\n- Aligned with main seeding system timing architecture\n\n## UI Enhancements\n- Added \"Clear All\" button next to Show Less/Show All buttons\n- Red styling to differentiate from blue Show buttons\n- Conditional display when replies exist and clear callback available\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"595dd4a0587699ade79fce8783cb3adfe5385280","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister/orbitandchill/git/trees/595dd4a0587699ade79fce8783cb3adfe5385280"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/julesmeister