Q6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commit/b8a57f3a3fca689bc104ff61f2ab67fdca4ce263","node_id":"C_kwDOPCeGZ9oAKGI4YTU3ZjNhM2ZjYTY4OWJjMTA0ZmY2MWYyYWI2N2ZkY2E0Y2UyNjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commit/1e27881781123e8aee6387a02e28e30771e844c8","sha":"1e27881781123e8aee6387a02e28e30771e844c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/1e27881781123e8aee6387a02e28e30771e844c8"}],"sha":"b8a57f3a3fca689bc104ff61f2ab67fdca4ce263","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/b8a57f3a3fca689bc104ff61f2ab67fdca4ce263"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108800804?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ermolaev-frontend/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ermolaev-frontend/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ermolaev-frontend/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ermolaev-frontend/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ermolaev-frontend","id":108800804,"login":"ermolaev-frontend","node_id":"U_kgDOBnwrJA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ermolaev-frontend/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ermolaev-frontend/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ermolaev-frontend/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ermolaev-frontend/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ermolaev-frontend/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ermolaev-frontend","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/1e27881781123e8aee6387a02e28e30771e844c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-18T17:25:26Z","email":"108800804+ermolaev-frontend@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Evgeniy Ermolaev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-18T17:25:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add shape management features to WebSocket integration (#31)\n\n* Add shape management features to WebSocket integration\n\n* Enhanced the configuration to include new message types for shape management: ADD_SHAPE, UPDATE_SHAPE, and DELETE_SHAPE.\n* Implemented corresponding handlers in MessageHandler to process these new message types.\n* Updated RoomManager to manage shape addition, updating, and deletion within rooms.\n* Refactored CanvasWrapper and useCanvasWrapper to support shape updates and integrate with WebSocket for real-time collaboration.\n* Modified EditorPage to handle shape updates and send shape-related messages via WebSocket, improving collaborative editing experience.\n\n* Add EMPTY_SHAPES message type and corresponding handler\n\n* Introduced a new message type, EMPTY_SHAPES, in the configuration for managing empty canvas states.\n* Implemented handleEmptyShapes method in MessageHandler to process EMPTY_SHAPES messages and clear the canvas for the specified room.\n* Updated useWebSocket to handle EMPTY_SHAPES messages and added sendEmptyShapes function for sending this message type.\n* Modified EditorPage to integrate the new empty shapes functionality, enhancing collaborative editing experience.\n\n* Refactor MessageHandler to streamline room checks for shape operations\n\n* Introduced a withRoom method to centralize room validation and callback execution for shape-related operations.\n* Updated handleAddShape, handleUpdateShape, handleDeleteShape, and handleEmptyShapes methods to utilize withRoom, improving code readability and reducing duplication.\n* Enhanced error handling by ensuring room presence is checked before processing shape messages.\n\n* Refactor MessageHandler to remove handleShapesArray method and streamline message processing\n\n* Eliminated the handleShapesArray method to simplify shape handling logic within the MessageHandler.\n* Updated message processing to focus on specific message types, enhancing code clarity and maintainability.\n* Improved overall structure by centralizing room validation within existing methods.\n\n* Refactor EditorPage to update canvas clearing functionality\n\n* Renamed handleClearCanvas to handleEmptyShapes for improved clarity in functionality.\n* Updated Toolbar component to reflect the new method name, enhancing code readability and maintainability.\n\n* Refactor Toolbar component to rename canvas clearing prop\n\n* Changed the prop name from onClearCanvas to onEmptyShapes in the Toolbar component for better clarity and consistency with the updated functionality in EditorPage.\n* Updated the corresponding usage in EditorPage to reflect this change, enhancing code readability.","tree":{"sha":"4bb1471103461775686abe37e1e6ecfaa11bcf0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/git/trees/4bb1471103461775686abe37e1e6ecfaa11bcf0b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/git/commits/1e27881781123e8aee6387a02e28e30771e844c8","verification":{"payload":"tree 4bb1471103461775686abe37e1e6ecfaa11bcf0b\nparent 1d45f8d2c7b9a58fb034a07a7d8d53b2d12ffede\nauthor Evgeniy Ermolaev <108800804+ermolaev-frontend@users.noreply.github.com> 1752859526 +0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1752859526 +0400\n\nAdd shape management features to WebSocket integration (#31)\n\n* Add shape management features to WebSocket integration\n\n* Enhanced the configuration to include new message types for shape management: ADD_SHAPE, UPDATE_SHAPE, and DELETE_SHAPE.\n* Implemented corresponding handlers in MessageHandler to process these new message types.\n* Updated RoomManager to manage shape addition, updating, and deletion within rooms.\n* Refactored CanvasWrapper and useCanvasWrapper to support shape updates and integrate with WebSocket for real-time collaboration.\n* Modified EditorPage to handle shape updates and send shape-related messages via WebSocket, improving collaborative editing experience.\n\n* Add EMPTY_SHAPES message type and corresponding handler\n\n* Introduced a new message type, EMPTY_SHAPES, in the configuration for managing empty canvas states.\n* Implemented handleEmptyShapes method in MessageHandler to process EMPTY_SHAPES messages and clear the canvas for the specified room.\n* Updated useWebSocket to handle EMPTY_SHAPES messages and added sendEmptyShapes function for sending this message type.\n* Modified EditorPage to integrate the new empty shapes functionality, enhancing collaborative editing experience.\n\n* Refactor MessageHandler to streamline room checks for shape operations\n\n* Introduced a withRoom method to centralize room validation and callback execution for shape-related operations.\n* Updated handleAddShape, handleUpdateShape, handleDeleteShape, and handleEmptyShapes methods to utilize withRoom, improving code readability and reducing duplication.\n* Enhanced error handling by ensuring room presence is checked before processing shape messages.\n\n* Refactor MessageHandler to remove handleShapesArray method and streamline message processing\n\n* Eliminated the handleShapesArray method to simplify shape handling logic within the MessageHandler.\n* Updated message processing to focus on specific message types, enhancing code clarity and maintainability.\n* Improved overall structure by centralizing room validation within existing methods.\n\n* Refactor EditorPage to update canvas clearing functionality\n\n* Renamed handleClearCanvas to handleEmptyShapes for improved clarity in functionality.\n* Updated Toolbar component to reflect the new method name, enhancing code readability and maintainability.\n\n* Refactor Toolbar component to rename canvas clearing prop\n\n* Changed the prop name from onClearCanvas to onEmptyShapes in the Toolbar component for better clarity and consistency with the updated functionality in EditorPage.\n* Updated the corresponding usage in EditorPage to reflect this change, enhancing code readability.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJoeoOGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAD3EQALBanpP28yRcCucBIVYREsb8\nxXsGVch5Q2HGskykJMBEq/vPZoLN9UvbnYyWMSY0bWL375uGybJ2CKZX5bcb9oxi\nCFwhdM+Vcj8GmCQxWfYksCuD/32gmy0NHcjbF7mXza7gFITMyD6lt6nuZcmvFS7i\ncsMzz8MLKImHXhZANLRZxOt9GplEVIhDtRYnlKQViwxrDZhmOqG8GAp/10WYEvGN\n40buW76Xu9pZ12YxMHMx0YV/1Kzd9BufXF0l5KH/tPlGGi1b4/XF5siiWg8ws729\n4S5jeGyMNgSD5ucy6zJ20sgREJfGz2Xi+SqN0NcloQ3PDXg8tjWxAfTUST6+ZPUE\niZeibefSWg7icx/OQgYxAG/dZqzt1LHU6w3qadydc3VW1PXILHHRGKWhAPAZuDtZ\nRpJ6SD5KMjPR62PhFFf9OpyF7j3hXHua6WBz4ep2ued5/6Wl1LWbhdDzXbipr9V1\nV72WfINNpqLYNWVT0gXoDGIYgXy0SlVAKTtfstnQZBmZmXdoQarUBQ2Vx4RxxP4a\ns6Zhh+gTyznq+xsV8eGoRb9E5q8urO73OUViltCVmuSWLRgSLRI+jabNONDyLiaU\n4zAnon13uKYGgbSlaUv7Y/Q8oJUma3Aw1+Pt/FQ7wZJ0skJbdKeqmctfE5+3xLNF\nEMCTBP4rvEoSA6TCq8N6\n=QAr0\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-07-18T17:25:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/