Z","email":"108800804+ermolaev-frontend@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Evgeniy Ermolaev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-11T15:32:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Added a Pan feature\n\n* Refactor Draftly class to improve cursor handling and shape interaction\n\n* Introduced a static HANDLE_CURSOR_MAP for better cursor management based on shape handles.\n* Refactored cursor setting logic to use a dedicated setCursor method, enhancing code clarity.\n* Simplified shape hover detection with a new isAnyShapeHovered method, improving performance and readability.\n* Updated IShape interface to maintain consistency in method signatures.\n\n* Add panning functionality to Draftly class for improved canvas interaction\n\n* Introduced viewport management for panning, allowing users to move the canvas view.\n* Updated interaction types to include ''panning'' and adjusted related logic for mouse events.\n* Enhanced mouse position calculations to account for viewport offsets during panning.\n* Refactored drawShapes method to save and restore canvas state during rendering.\n* Improved cursor handling to reflect panning state, enhancing user experience.\n\n* Refactor cursor handling in Draftly class\n\n* Updated setCursor method to accept CSSStyleDeclaration[''cursor''] type for improved type safety.\n* Changed default cursor setting in deselectShape method to ''default1'', enhancing cursor management consistency.","tree":{"sha":"af11b7d856a2893897a616ed3efa03a83b13ccea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/git/trees/af11b7d856a2893897a616ed3efa03a83b13ccea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/git/commits/afc456dce5ee03cee09645fe51b28059a670f9b3","verification":{"payload":"tree af11b7d856a2893897a616ed3efa03a83b13ccea\nparent 1bef9df0fb790d4f7210520474831bda5c0ba59e\nauthor Evgeniy Ermolaev <108800804+ermolaev-frontend@users.noreply.github.com> 1752247925 +0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1752247925 +0400\n\nAdded a Pan feature\n\n* Refactor Draftly class to improve cursor handling and shape interaction\n\n* Introduced a static HANDLE_CURSOR_MAP for better cursor management based on shape handles.\n* Refactored cursor setting logic to use a dedicated setCursor method, enhancing code clarity.\n* Simplified shape hover detection with a new isAnyShapeHovered method, improving performance and readability.\n* Updated IShape interface to maintain consistency in method signatures.\n\n* Add panning functionality to Draftly class for improved canvas interaction\n\n* Introduced viewport management for panning, allowing users to move the canvas view.\n* Updated interaction types to include ''panning'' and adjusted related logic for mouse events.\n* Enhanced mouse position calculations to account for viewport offsets during panning.\n* Refactored drawShapes method to save and restore canvas state during rendering.\n* Improved cursor handling to reflect panning state, enhancing user experience.\n\n* Refactor cursor handling in Draftly class\n\n* Updated setCursor method to accept CSSStyleDeclaration[''cursor''] type for improved type safety.\n* Changed default cursor setting in deselectShape method to ''default1'', enhancing cursor management consistency.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJocS51CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfi8QAGRNa7g5vBqHBfBEZu+BfJGG\nmf4Bf5pXySr67XK5mIZPyANkGxEQoZ7VTRo0Qf6lZR1EFAwHMprmz5feCJmpP0B3\nFCqoYO8d5YMFnZy9QmwPDomTT1B3CESfZeVqL2391JWemFFub3FFfln7eWzVLSKL\nQzmUf42NoY62BFB5AeV7XRYbSesWgltWoglqg8ckFdrW630H2pEk6HZOX0lCbaRN\nWu1oNaVumXGEsVP7k//Xxqd/LlnFwPa2y6kdoPf/pj/bR6jEMAxMHi3ncsEctObG\nrs32zNW+tzLUgkBqZoofGOyH6fYHkRozyxBolL3sSxtZUwoxd6gc2RtPTryMOc0M\nyIRJWCYb+PjnIQ4HD4aXKW6ladEqNU3eDRv+4aSjtp5kKhHIj2pGw0Vda8j0rRxK\nwmL3floorb0apHWP5bVBTVd55BIZm1hXoOhZTyaujl9ZFhvDJIrkM0t8vkQSH/jf\nRj3caHkNUWAg3RFm8rLJJvVlIMntKtaOiMTxJqv4WnITfhfCyLoEN5L294FQoVv5\n7To+BXVkDQYOy7Ep1s37zQGMvap6NwVtPit+N90Q+VOCg6