es the Docker build step in the deploy_main.yml workflow to change the build context to the root directory and updates the Dockerfile path to ensure accurate file referencing during the build process. This adjustment enhances the reliability of the deployment workflow.","tree":{"sha":"4d9cb489153e3fdb388efe086659f22ed67559cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/git/trees/4d9cb489153e3fdb388efe086659f22ed67559cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/git/commits/37c1494b9ff9352f61c6a36ead324771b45598b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commit/37c1494b9ff9352f61c6a36ead324771b45598b8","node_id":"C_kwDOPCeGZ9oAKDM3YzE0OTRiOWZmOTM1MmY2MWM2YTM2ZWFkMzI0NzcxYjQ1NTk4Yjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commit/c8fee029da3c82f04dcfcd4e7b9cd872805a2d9c","sha":"c8fee029da3c82f04dcfcd4e7b9cd872805a2d9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/c8fee029da3c82f04dcfcd4e7b9cd872805a2d9c"}],"sha":"37c1494b9ff9352f61c6a36ead324771b45598b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/37c1494b9ff9352f61c6a36ead324771b45598b8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/c8fee029da3c82f04dcfcd4e7b9cd872805a2d9c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-09T09:02:16Z","email":"e.ermolaev@unlimit.com","name":"ermolaev-unlimint"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-09T09:02:16Z","email":"e.ermolaev@unlimit.com","name":"ermolaev-unlimint"},"message":"Update pull request workflow to adjust Docker build context and file path\n\nThis commit modifies the Docker build step in the pull_request.yml workflow to change the build context to the root directory and updates the file path for the Dockerfile to reflect its location within the ''ci'' directory. This adjustment ensures that the build process correctly references the necessary files, improving the workflow''s reliability.","tree":{"sha":"0fb415a344233efd3864ee8c36a244ba347c3705","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/git/trees/0fb415a344233efd3864ee8c36a244ba347c3705"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/git/commits/c8fee029da3c82f04dcfcd4e7b9cd872805a2d9c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commit/c8fee029da3c82f04dcfcd4e7b9cd872805a2d9c","node_id":"C_kwDOPCeGZ9oAKGM4ZmVlMDI5ZGEzYzgyZjA0ZGNmY2Q0ZTdiOWNkODcyODA1YTJkOWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commit/4ca8a058538312eaa7d040a9df300b695196ab0f","sha":"4ca8a058538312eaa7d040a9df300b695196ab0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/4ca8a058538312eaa7d040a9df300b695196ab0f"}],"sha":"c8fee029da3c82f04dcfcd4e7b9cd872805a2d9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/c8fee029da3c82f04dcfcd4e7b9cd872805a2d9c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/4ca8a058538312eaa7d040a9df300b695196ab0f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-09T08:58:58Z","email":"e.ermolaev@unlimit.com","name":"ermolaev-unlimint"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-09T08:58:58Z","email":"e.ermolaev@unlimit.com","name":"ermolaev-unlimint"},"message":"Add file listing step to pull request workflow\n\nThis commit introduces a new step in the pull_request.yml workflow to list files in the ''ci'' directory. This addition aids in debugging and ensures visibility of the CI-related files during the pull request process.","tree":{"sha":"5560f4a9b0defc52edc1e053f30a65e72707b490","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/git/trees/5560f4a9b0defc52edc1e053f30a65e72707b49