clarity and remove unused elements\n\nThis commit removes the shapeIdCounter from the CanvasEditor class and eliminates unnecessary console logging in the isPointInShape method. In the Rectangle class, redundant lines in the draw method and the drawSelection method have been cleaned up, enhancing overall readability and maintainability of the codebase.","tree":{"sha":"657804454434c54d6748883308e2ff074187f78a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/git/trees/657804454434c54d6748883308e2ff074187f78a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/git/commits/1e160c4fcf74017b0eccc49e2df89d57db179091","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commit/1e160c4fcf74017b0eccc49e2df89d57db179091","node_id":"C_kwDOPCeGZ9oAKDFlMTYwYzRmY2Y3NDAxN2IwZWNjYzQ5ZTJkZjg5ZDU3ZGIxNzkwOTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commit/60d2ec5011e1f27d5444d5c91c8364b68fe716c4","sha":"60d2ec5011e1f27d5444d5c91c8364b68fe716c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/60d2ec5011e1f27d5444d5c91c8364b68fe716c4"}],"sha":"1e160c4fcf74017b0eccc49e2df89d57db179091","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/1e160c4fcf74017b0eccc49e2df89d57db179091"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/60d2ec5011e1f27d5444d5c91c8364b68fe716c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-08T11:12:32Z","email":"e.ermolaev@unlimit.com","name":"ermolaev-unlimint"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-08T11:12:32Z","email":"e.ermolaev@unlimit.com","name":"ermolaev-unlimint"},"message":"Enhance CanvasEditor with unique ID generation and streamline shape drawing logic\n\nThis commit updates the CanvasEditor class to utilize the new generateId function for creating unique identifiers for shapes. The drawing logic for the pencil tool has been refined, replacing the previous implementation with a more efficient approach using the rough.js library. Additionally, unnecessary code related to shape drawing has been removed, improving overall clarity and maintainability.","tree":{"sha":"e5f82ac34768b0a73eb251c0d902864d7f80a369","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/git/trees/e5f82ac34768b0a73eb251c0d902864d7f80a369"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/git/commits/60d2ec5011e1f27d5444d5c91c8364b68fe716c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commit/60d2ec5011e1f27d5444d5c91c8364b68fe716c4","node_id":"C_kwDOPCeGZ9oAKDYwZDJlYzUwMTFlMWYyN2Q1NDQ0ZDVjOTFjODM2NGI2OGZlNzE2YzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commit/57a15f94f279f8e51af44b1ebcd58b45c49d9570","sha":"57a15f94f279f8e51af44b1ebcd58b45c49d9570","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/57a15f94f279f8e51af44b1ebcd58b45c49d9570"}],"sha":"60d2ec5011e1f27d5444d5c91c8364b68fe716c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/60d2ec5011e1f27d5444d5c91c8364b68fe716c4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/57a15f94f279f8e51af44b1ebcd58b45c49d9570/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-08T10:44:58Z","email":"e.ermolaev@unlimit.com","name":"ermolaev-unlimint"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-08T10:44:58Z","email":"e.ermolaev@unlimit.com","name":"ermolaev-unlimint"},"message":"Add utility functions for ID generation and randomization in canvasUtils\n\nThis commit introduces several utility functions in canvasUtils, including generateId for creating unique identifiers, getRandomColor for selecting random colors from a predefined array, getRandomStrokeWidth for random stroke width selection, and getRandom for generating random numbers within a specified range. Additionally, a new helper function, getRandomFromArray, is added to retrieve a random element from an array, enhancing the utility of the canvas module.","tree":{"sha":"a26ab37a11450585a517086c9392dbfd073935d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/git/trees/a26ab37a11450585a517086c9392dbfd073935d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/git/commits/57a15f94f279f8e51af44b1ebcd58b45c49d9570","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commit/57a15f94f279f8e51af44b1ebcd58b45c49d9570","node_id":"C_kwDOPCeGZ9oAKDU3YTE1Zjk0ZjI3OWY4ZTUxYWY0NGIxZWJjZDU4YjQ1YzQ5ZDk1NzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commit/fe4c1e0cde33a7686d68fb1b4a35ce4ad5da4a4c","sha":"fe4c1e0cde33a7686d68fb1b4a35ce4ad5da4a4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/fe4c1e0cde33a7686d68fb1b4a35ce4ad5da4a4c"}],"sha":"57a15f94f279f8e51af44b1ebcd58b45c49d9570","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/57a15f94f279f8e51af44b1ebcd58b45c49d9570"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/fe4c1e0cde33a7686d68fb1b4a35ce4ad5da4a4c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-07T18:15:12Z","email":"e.ermolaev@unlimit.com","name":"ermolaev-unlimint"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-07T18:15:12Z","email":"e.ermolaev@unlimit.com","name":"ermolaev-unlimint"},"message":"Refactor CanvasEditor to streamline shape creation and interaction handling\n\nThis commit updates the CanvasEditor class to improve the logic for shape creation during mouse interactions. The handling of drawing tools has been consolidated, and shapes are now created and added to the shapes array more efficiently. Additionally, the requestDraw method is called only when a new shape is created, enhancing performance. Unused console logging has been removed to clean up the codebase.","tree":{"sha":"0a3cea3f3d121e0c40feaae4609d637e25a3e0fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/git/trees/0a3cea3f3d121e0c40feaae4609d637e25a3e0fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/git/commits/fe4c1e0cde33a7686d68fb1b4a35ce4ad5da4a4c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commit/fe4c1e0cde33a7686d68fb1b4a35ce4ad5da4a4c","node_id":"C_kwDOPCeGZ9oAKGZlNGMxZTBjZGUzM2E3Njg2ZDY4ZmIxYjRhMzVjZTRhZDVkYTRhNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commit/5eaddcff052bedc6a84b526f2d872821d658a649","sha":"5eaddcff052bedc6a84b526f2d872821d658a649","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/5eaddcff052bedc6a84b526f2d872821d658a649"}],"sha":"fe4c1e0cde33a7686d68fb1b4a35ce4ad5da4a4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/fe4c1e0cde33a7686d68fb1b4a35ce4ad5da4a4c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/5eaddcff052bedc6a84b526f2d872821d658a649/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-07T17:18:50Z","email":"e.ermolaev@unlimit.com","name":"ermolaev-unlimint"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-07T17:18:50Z","email":"e.ermolaev@unlimit.com","name":"ermolaev-unlimint"},"message":"Remove CanvasEditor and Interaction classes to streamline canvas functionality\n\nThis commit deletes the CanvasEditor and Interaction classes, consolidating canvas-related logic into a more organized structure. The CanvasEditorWrapper component is updated to import the CanvasEditor from a new location, enhancing the overall architecture. This refactor aims to simplify the codebase and improve maintainability by reducing redundancy in shape handling and interaction management.","tree":{"sha":"7eb017b2972bfb095cc802fbb2da7062188e1fb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/git/trees/7eb017b2972bfb095cc802fbb2da7062188e1fb5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/git/commits/5eaddcff052bedc6a84b526f2d872821d658a649","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commit/5eaddcff052bedc6a84b526f2d872821d658a649","node_id":"C_kwDOPCeGZ9oAKDVlYWRkY2ZmMDUyYmVkYzZhODRiNTI2ZjJkODcyODIxZDY1OGE2NDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commit/267b2bf520a135154f4ece2f484da7096f416a9c","sha":"267b2bf520a135154f4ece2f484da7096f416a9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/267b2bf520a135154f4ece2f484da7096f416a9c"}],"sha":"5eaddcff052bedc6a84b526f2d872821d658a649","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/5eaddcff052bedc6a84b526f2d872821d658a649"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/267b2bf520a135154f4ece2f484da7096f416a9c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-07T09:34:32Z","email":"e.ermolaev@unlimit.com","name":"ermolaev-unlimint"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-07T09:34:32Z","email":"e.ermolaev@unlimit.com","name":"ermolaev-unlimint"},"message":"Refactor CanvasEditor to simplify method signatures and improve shape interaction handling\n\nThis commit updates the CanvasEditor class by removing the public access modifier from several methods, enhancing code consistency. The logic for deleting and deselecting shapes has been streamlined, and destructuring is used to improve readability when accessing interaction properties. Additionally, console logging has been adjusted for clarity during debugging, contributing to overall code maintainability.","tree":{"sha":"cae075714bffe7608c77453ec1c4a6167c3161d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/git/trees/cae075714bffe7608c77453ec1c4a6167c3161d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/git/commits/267b2bf520a135154f4ece2f484da7096f416a9c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commit/267b2bf520a135154f4ece2f484da7096f416a9c","node_id":"C_kwDOPCeGZ9oAKDI2N2IyYmY1MjBhMTM1MTU0ZjRlY2UyZjQ4NGRhNzA5NmY0MTZhOWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commit/1a10a919385d78960f03bf9539ac65ab87ffcfe4","sha":"1a10a919385d78960f03bf9539ac65ab87ffcfe4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/1a10a919385d78960f03bf9539ac65ab87ffcfe4"}],"sha":"267b2bf520a135154f4ece2f484da7096f416a9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/267b2bf520a135154f4ece2f484da7096f416a9c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/1a10a919385d78960f03bf9539ac65ab87ffcfe4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-07T08:17:27Z","email":"e.ermolaev@unlimit.com","name":"ermolaev-unlimint"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-07T08:17:27Z","email":"e.ermolaev@unlimit.com","name":"ermolaev-unlimint"},"message":"Refactor CanvasEditor and Interaction classes to enhance interaction logic and shape handling\n\nThis commit introduces a new utility function, radToDeg, for converting radians to degrees and simplifies the Interaction class by initializing properties with default values. The CanvasEditor class has been updated to streamline rotation handling for shapes, removing redundant calculations and improving overall code clarity. Additionally, the getRandomStrokeWidth method has been refactored to select from a predefined array, enhancing maintainability.","tree":{"sha":"b8ba578d27702a1aef3ab40a6ac31638e97e5f53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/git/trees/b8ba578d27702a1aef3ab40a6ac31638e97e5f53"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/git/commits/1a10a919385d78960f03bf9539ac65ab87ffcfe4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commit/1a10a919385d78960f03bf9539ac65ab87ffcfe4","node_id":"C_kwDOPCeGZ9oAKDFhMTBhOTE5Mzg1ZDc4OTYwZjAzYmY5NTM5YWM2NWFiODdmZmNmZTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commit/358db2e80dfc88ecfb6d0b0ad98d5806ea83e5b4","sha":"358db2e80dfc88ecfb6d0b0ad98d5806ea83e5b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/358db2e80dfc88ecfb6d0b0ad98d5806ea83e5b4"}],"sha":"1a10a919385d78960f03bf9539ac65ab87ffcfe4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/1a10a919385d78960f03bf9539ac65ab87ffcfe4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/358db2e80dfc88ecfb6d0b0ad98d5806ea83e5b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-07T05:50:28Z","email":"e.ermolaev@unlimit.com","name":"ermolaev-unlimint"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-07T05:50:28Z","email":"e.ermolaev@unlimit.com","name":"ermolaev-unlimint"},"message":"Refactor CanvasEditor to improve shape bounds handling and interaction logic\n\nThis commit updates the CanvasEditor class by refining the getShapeBounds method to return a Bounds type, enhancing type clarity. The interaction logic has been streamlined to reduce redundancy, particularly in shape handling during resizing and rotation. Additionally, the method signatures for retrieving handles have been updated for consistency, improving overall code maintainability.","tree":{"sha":"316fdc9ea75ea49bb612a5ff76cd0be247e8d3bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e