,"name":"ermolaev-unlimint"},"message":"Refactor CanvasEditor to improve code clarity and remove unused variables\n\nUpdate CanvasEditor by directly accessing canvas dimensions instead of storing them in separate variables. Remove commented-out code related to initial radius and distance, and simplify drag offset calculations. Additionally, refine interaction state checks for drawing tools to enhance readability.","tree":{"sha":"0767530c05b2836e6bc166e8ec1cf51b434c2c26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/git/trees/0767530c05b2836e6bc166e8ec1cf51b434c2c26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/git/commits/550bbb6c8804ac3fceb5189445b785e1018b68db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commit/550bbb6c8804ac3fceb5189445b785e1018b68db","node_id":"C_kwDOPCeGZ9oAKDU1MGJiYjZjODgwNGFjM2ZjZWI1MTg5NDQ1Yjc4NWUxMDE4YjY4ZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commit/5d731c109a8a6f8318bb29494e56122e1ad0ad82","sha":"5d731c109a8a6f8318bb29494e56122e1ad0ad82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/5d731c109a8a6f8318bb29494e56122e1ad0ad82"}],"sha":"550bbb6c8804ac3fceb5189445b785e1018b68db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/550bbb6c8804ac3fceb5189445b785e1018b68db"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ermolaev-frontend/draftly/commits/5d731c109a8a6f8318bb29494e56122e1ad0ad82/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-05T16:06:02Z","email":"e.ermolaev@unlimit.com","name":"ermolaev-unlimint"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-05T16:06:02Z","email":"e.ermolaev@unlimit.com","name":"ermolaev-unlimint"},"message":"Enhance CanvasEditor and utility types with Point interface\n\nIntroduce a new Point interface to standardize point representation across the CanvasEdi