"author":{"date":"2025-06-26T21:29:42Z","email":"camilobzt@gmail.com","name":"Juan Camilo Bazurto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-26T21:29:42Z","email":"camilobzt@gmail.com","name":"Juan Camilo Bazurto"},"message":"feat: Refactor Blob Storage Admin interface and integrate CheckPoint validation\n\n- Updated package.json to change development and start ports from 3009 to 3010.\n- Added BlobStorageAdmin component with file upload functionality and CheckPoint validation.\n- Created BlobListSection, NotificationBanner, and StatsSection components for better UI organization.\n- Implemented useBlobStorage and useCheckPointValidation hooks for managing blob operations and security checks.\n- Removed unused Home module and its associated styles.\n- Added new styles for BlobStorageAdmin and its components.\n- Integrated Redux Toolkit with blob storage and CheckPoint APIs.\n- Updated tests to reflect changes in the Home component to BlobStorageAdmin.","tree":{"sha":"802e6f48fdca91834d0e95201ba23230af8f6688","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CamiloBzt/BlobStorage/git/trees/802e6f48fdca91834d0e95201ba23230af8f6688"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CamiloBzt/BlobStorage/git/commits/5f122fad21162ed3b07544ca117b191e7d720ac4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73189362?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloBzt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloBzt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloBzt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloBzt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloBzt","id":73189362,"login":"CamiloBzt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMTg5MzYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloBzt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloBzt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloBzt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloBzt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloBzt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloBzt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloBzt/BlobStorage/commit/5f122fad21162ed3b07544ca117b191e7d720ac4","node_id":"C_kwDOPChgPdoAKDVmMTIyZmFkMjExNjJlZDNiMDc1NDRjYTExN2IxOTFlN2Q3MjBhYzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloBzt/BlobStorage/commit/2d6bcb77439c00569af9378cc215fd90dec413fc","sha":"2d6bcb77439c00569af9378cc215fd90dec413fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CamiloBzt/BlobStorage/commits/2d6bcb77439c00569af9378cc215fd90dec413fc"}],"sha":"5f122fad21162ed3b07544ca117b191e7d720ac4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CamiloBzt/BlobStorage/commits/5f122fad21162ed3b07544ca117b191e7d720ac4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73189362?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloBzt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloBzt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloBzt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloBzt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloBzt","id":73189362,"login":"CamiloBzt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMTg5MzYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloBzt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloBzt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloBzt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloBzt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloBzt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloBzt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CamiloBzt/BlobStorage/commits/2d6bcb77439c00569af9378cc215fd90dec413fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-26T19:54:33Z","email":"camilobzt@gmail.com","name":"Juan Camilo Bazurto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-26T19:54:33Z","email":"camilobzt@gmail.com","name":"Juan Camilo Bazurto"},"message":"feat: Implement hooks for event handling and table pagination\n\n- Added `useEvents` hook to manage token setting via custom events.\n- Created `useTablePagination` hook for managing pagination state with customizable initial values.\n- Introduced `useBreadCrumb` hook for managing breadcrumb state in Redux.\n- Developed tests for `useEvents` and `useTablePagination` hooks to ensure functionality.\n\nfeat: Set up Axios adapter for HTTP requests\n\n- Implemented `AxiosAdapter` class to handle HTTP requests with Axios.\n- Created an interface `IHttpAdapter` to define the structure for HTTP adapters.\n- Added methods for setting custom headers and managing tokens.\n- Developed tests for `AxiosAdapter` to verify GET and POST request handling.\n\nfeat: Middleware for CORS handling\n\n- Created middleware to append CORS headers for API requests.\n- Ensured WebSocket and internal Next.js requests bypass CORS checks.\n\nfeat: Redux store setup and page state management\n\n- Configured Redux store with a slice for managing page state and breadcrumbs.\n- Added tests for Redux store to verify state updates.\n\nfeat: Utility functions for date formatting and header management\n\n- Implemented `formatDate` utility to format date strings.\n- Created `addCustomHeaders` utility to append custom headers from the HTTP adapter.\n\nstyle: Added global styles and home page styles\n\n- Defined global styles and variables for consistent theming across the application.\n- Styled the home page with a simple layout.\n\ntest: Comprehensive test coverage for utilities and components\n\n- Added tests for date formatting and header utility functions.\n- Created tests for the home page to ensure correct rendering and functionality.","tree":{"sha":"b4524770cddb83a9db9ca0bfd092661e5ed3de7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CamiloBzt/BlobStorage/git/trees/b4524770cddb83a9db9ca0bfd092661e5ed3de7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CamiloBzt/BlobStorage/git/commits/2d6bcb77439c00569af9378cc215fd90dec413fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73189362?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloBzt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloBzt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloBzt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloBzt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloBzt","id":73189362,"login":"CamiloBzt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMTg5MzYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloBzt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloBzt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloBzt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloBzt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloBzt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloBzt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloBzt/BlobStorage/commit/2d6bcb77439c00569af9378cc215fd90dec413fc","node_id":"C_kwDOPChgPdoAKDJkNmJjYjc3NDM5YzAwNTY5YWY5Mzc4Y2MyMTVmZDkwZGVjNDEzZmM","parents":[],"sha":"2d6bcb77439c00569af9378cc215fd90dec413fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CamiloBzt/BlobStorage/commits/2d6bcb77439c00569af9378cc215fd90dec413fc"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/CamiloBzt/BlobStorage/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=923f48999f1b9dc8bbed8e74787d1c02cbd4cf20&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A42%3A39.646Z"}');
